var SXe={playoff_series:{answers:[{key:"glass",text:a("Win the boards and every loose ball","抢下每个篮板和地板球","搶下每個籃板和地板球"),lean:{discipline:1,resilience:1},apply:(e,o)=>{he(e,3),Qo(e,o,["rebounding","athleticism"],{discipline:1,resilience:1})}},{key:"tempo",text:a("Push the pace from the first whistle","从第一声哨响就提速","從第一聲哨響就提速"),hint:a("Fresh legs win it; tired ones lose it","腿有劲就赢，腿软了就输","腿有力就贏，腿軟了就輸"),lean:{risk:1,ambition:1},apply:(e,o)=>{let n=k(e,ke(e,{bravery:1,risk:1}));Da(e,n,xe(e,"playoff_series.tempo.ok",[a("You ran from the first whistle, and {opp} were bent over their knees by the third quarter.","你从第一声哨响就开始跑，第三节{opp}的球员已经扶着膝盖喘气了。","你從第一聲哨響就開始跑，第三節{opp}的球員已經扶著膝蓋喘氣了。"),a("You set a pace {opp} could not live with. By the third quarter they were walking the ball up.","你定下的节奏{opp}根本跟不上。到第三节，他们已经只能慢慢把球运过半场。","你定下的節奏{opp}根本跟不上。到第三節，他們已經只能慢慢把球運過半場。"),a("You ran and ran. Somewhere in the third quarter, {opp} stopped running back.","你一直跑、一直跑。第三节打着打着，{opp}就不再回防了。","你一直跑、一直跑。第三節打著打著，{opp}就不再回防了。")]),xe(e,"playoff_series.tempo.bad",[a("You ran from the first whistle, and by the fourth quarter your own legs were gone.","你从第一声哨响就开始跑，结果到第四节你自己先跑不动了。","你從第一聲哨響就開始跑，結果到第四節你自己先跑不動了。"),a("You pushed the pace all series. In the fourth quarters it was your legs that asked for a break.","整个系列赛你都在提速。到了第四节，先喊着要休息的是你自己的腿。","整個系列賽你都在提速。到了第四節，先喊著要休息的是你自己的腿。"),a("You started at a sprint and ended at a walk. The fourth quarters belonged to fresher legs.","你开场全力冲刺，最后只剩慢慢走。第四节属于腿还有劲的人。","你開場全力衝刺，最後只剩慢慢走。第四節屬於腿還有力的人。")]),o),Qo(e,o,["athleticism","finishing"],{bravery:1,risk:1},n?.4:-.6)}},{key:"bench",text:a("Tell the bench players they will decide it","告诉替补们：这一轮靠他们","告訴替補們：這一輪靠他們"),lean:{empathy:2,charisma:1},apply:(e,o)=>{let n=k(e,Pe(e,.5,{charisma:1,empathy:1}));ce(e,n?5:1),Da(e,n,xe(e,"playoff_series.bench.ok",[a("The bench believed you. Their ten minutes a night felt like thirty.","替补们相信了你。他们每晚那十分钟，打得像三十分钟。","替補們相信了你。他們每晚那十分鐘，打得像三十分鐘。"),a("You told the bench this round was theirs, and they played like it: every minute at full speed.","你告诉替补这一轮是他们的，他们也真的打出了那个样子：每一分钟都全速。","你告訴替補這一輪是他們的，他們也真的打出了那個樣子：每一分鐘都全速。"),a("The second unit walked on the court like starters. The other side noticed the difference at once.","第二阵容上场时像首发一样有底气。对方马上就察觉到了不同。","第二陣容上場時像先發一樣有底氣。對方馬上就察覺到了不同。")]),xe(e,"playoff_series.bench.bad",[a("The bench nodded politely. Then they played like bench players.","替补们礼貌地点了点头，然后还是打得像替补。","替補們禮貌地點了點頭，然後還是打得像替補。"),a("Your speech to the bench got polite nods and not much else. Their minutes went by quietly.","你对替补的那番话换来几下礼貌的点头，仅此而已。他们的上场时间平平淡淡地过去了。","你對替補的那番話換來幾下禮貌的點頭，僅此而已。他們的上場時間平平淡淡地過去了。"),a("You put the round in the bench players’ hands. They handed it back by the second game.","你把这一轮交到替补手里。第二场他们就把它还给了你。","你把這一輪交到替補手上。第二場他們就把它還給了你。")]),o),Qo(e,o,["passing","iq"],{empathy:1})}},{key:"refs",text:a("Learn how this referee crew calls a game","摸清这组裁判的判罚尺度","摸清這組裁判的判罰尺度"),lean:{intelligence:1,patience:1},apply:(e,o)=>{_(e,"intelligence",1),Qo(e,o,["iq","mid"],{intelligence:1,patience:1})}},{key:"socks",text:a("Wear the same lucky socks until you lose","穿同一双幸运袜，直到输球为止","穿同一雙幸運襪，直到輸球為止"),lean:{creativity:1,risk:1},apply:(e,o)=>{ce(e,2),l(e,"happiness",1),d(e,xe(e,"playoff_series.socks.line",[a("You wore the same socks all series against {opp}. Your teammates laughed, then quietly changed seats on the bus.","对{opp}的整个系列赛你都穿同一双袜子。队友们笑了，然后悄悄在巴士上换了座位。","對{opp}的整個系列賽你都穿同一雙襪子。隊友們笑了，然後悄悄在巴士上換了座位。"),a("The lucky socks stayed on for every game against {opp}, unwashed. By the end your teammates gave you a whole row of the bus.","对{opp}的每一场你都穿着那双幸运袜，一次没洗。到最后，队友们把巴士上一整排都让给了你。","對{opp}的每一場你都穿著那雙幸運襪，一次沒洗。到最後，隊友們把巴士上一整排都讓給了你。"),a("Same socks, every game against {opp}. The team laughed at first. Then the kit man started wearing gloves.","对{opp}的每一场都是同一双袜子。队友们一开始还笑，后来装备管理员开始戴手套了。","對{opp}的每一場都是同一雙襪子。隊友們一開始還笑，後來裝備管理員開始戴手套了。")]),{opp:o.opp}),Qo(e,o,["three","mid"],{resilience:1})}}],words:[{glass:a("Own the glass and the floor","篮板和地板球都是你的","籃板和地板球都是你的"),tempo:a("Run them from the opening tip","一开场就跟他们拼速度","一開場就跟他們拚速度"),bench:a("Make the bench believe this round is theirs","让替补相信这一轮属于他们","讓替補相信這一輪屬於他們"),refs:a("Study how the referees call it","研究裁判的吹罚习惯","研究裁判的吹判習慣"),socks:a("Keep the lucky socks on until the luck runs out","幸运袜一直穿，穿到不灵为止","幸運襪一直穿，穿到不靈為止")},{glass:a("Do the dirty work under the rim","在篮下干脏活累活","在籃下做苦工"),tempo:a("Make it a fast, tired series","把系列赛打成一场速度消耗战","把系列賽打成一場速度消耗戰"),bench:a("Fire up the second unit","把第二阵容点燃","把第二陣容點燃"),refs:a("Find out what this crew lets go","弄清这组裁判放什么、吹什么","弄清這組裁判放什麼、吹什麼"),socks:a("Same socks every game, unwashed","每场同一双袜子，不洗","每場同一雙襪子，不洗")},{glass:a("Chase every rebound like it is the last","每个篮板都当最后一个去抢","每個籃板都當最後一個去搶"),tempo:a("Push it until somebody breaks","一直提速，直到有人撑不住","一直提速，直到有人撐不住"),bench:a("Put this series in the bench players’ hands","把这轮交到替补手里","把這輪交到替補手上"),refs:a("Read the referees before you read the defence","先读懂裁判，再读懂防守","先讀懂裁判，再讀懂防守"),socks:a("Trust the socks, not the scouting report","相信袜子，不信球探报告","相信襪子，不信球探報告")}]},playoff_road:{answers:[{key:"early",text:a("Arrive early and shoot in their empty arena","提早到，在他们空荡荡的球馆里投篮","提早到，在他們空蕩蕩的球館裡投籃"),lean:{discipline:2},apply:(e,o)=>{let n=k(e,se(e,.5,["three"],{discipline:1}));n?we(e,1):l(e,"happiness",-1),Da(e,n,xe(e,"playoff_road.early.ok",[a("You shot alone in their arena hours before the game. By tip-off their rims felt like yours.","比赛前几个小时，你一个人在他们的球馆里投篮。开赛时，他们的篮筐已经像你自己家的一样。","比賽前幾個小時，你一個人在他們的球館裡投籃。開賽時，他們的籃框已經像你自己家的一樣。"),a("Hours before tip-off you had their arena to yourself. By the game, you knew every dead spot on their floor.","开赛前几个小时，整座球馆只有你一个人。到比赛时，他们地板上哪里弹得不好你都一清二楚。","開賽前幾個小時，整座球館只有你一個人。到比賽時，他們地板上哪裡彈得不好你都一清二楚。"),a("You were the first one in their building and shot until the rims stopped feeling strange. The game felt like a home game.","你是第一个进他们球馆的人，一直投到篮筐不再陌生为止。那场比赛打起来就像主场。","你是第一個進他們球館的人，一直投到籃框不再陌生為止。那場比賽打起來就像主場。")]),xe(e,"playoff_road.early.bad",[a("You went to shoot in their empty arena. A security guard turned off the lights halfway through.","你跑去他们空荡荡的球馆投篮，投到一半，保安把灯关了。","你跑去他們空蕩蕩的球館投籃，投到一半，警衛把燈關了。"),a("You got to their arena early to shoot. Twenty shots in, the cleaning crew asked you to move so they could mop.","你提早去他们的球馆投篮。投了二十球，清洁人员就请你让开，他们要拖地。","你提早去他們的球館投籃。投了二十球，清潔人員就請你讓開，他們要拖地。"),a("Your early shootaround in their empty arena did not last. Someone there switched the lights off on you.","你在他们空荡荡的球馆里提前投篮，没投多久，就有人直接把灯给你关了。","你在他們空蕩蕩的球館裡提前投籃，沒投多久，就有人直接把燈給你關了。")]),o),Qo(e,o,["three","mid"],{discipline:1})}},{key:"wave",text:a("Wave to their fans in warm-ups and enjoy it","热身时向对方球迷挥手，享受这一切","熱身時向對方球迷揮手，享受這一切"),hint:a("It can fire you up, or get to you","可能让你更来劲，也可能让你乱了阵脚","可能讓你更來勁，也可能讓你亂了陣腳"),lean:{charisma:1,risk:1},apply:(e,o)=>{let n=k(e,ke(e,{charisma:1,bravery:1}));n&&ye(e,3),Da(e,n,xe(e,"playoff_road.wave.ok",[a("You waved, they booed louder, and you smiled wider. The clip went round the league.","你挥手，他们嘘得更大声，你笑得更开心。这段视频传遍了整个联盟。","你揮手，他們噓得更大聲，你笑得更開心。這段影片傳遍了整個聯盟。"),a("The louder they booed, the bigger you waved. Half the league shared the clip by morning.","他们嘘得越大声，你挥手挥得越起劲。第二天早上，半个联盟都在转发那段视频。","他們噓得越大聲，你揮手揮得越起勁。隔天早上，半個聯盟都在轉傳那段影片。"),a("You waved to their crowd like an old friend. They booed; everyone watching at home laughed along.","你像跟老朋友打招呼一样向他们的观众挥手。他们嘘你，在家看比赛的人都跟着笑了。","你像跟老朋友打招呼一樣向他們的觀眾揮手。他們噓你，在家看比賽的人都跟著笑了。")]),xe(e,"playoff_road.wave.bad",[a("You enjoyed the boos a little too much and forced every shot early on.","你有点太享受嘘声了，开局每一球都在硬投。","你有點太享受噓聲了，開局每一球都在硬投。"),a("The boos got into your head after all. You tried to answer each one with a shot, and missed most.","嘘声还是钻进了你的脑子。你想用每一球去回应每一声嘘，结果大多没进。","噓聲還是鑽進了你的腦袋。你想用每一球去回應每一聲噓，結果大多沒進。"),a("You waved, they booed, and you spent the first quarter trying to win the argument with long shots.","你挥手，他们嘘，你整个第一节都在用远投跟他们较劲。","你揮手，他們噓，你整個第一節都在用遠投跟他們較勁。")]),o),Qo(e,o,["three","finishing"],{bravery:1,charisma:1},n?.2:-.3)}},{key:"steal",text:a("Aim to steal just one game there","目标只是在那里偷下一场","目標只是在那裡偷下一場"),lean:{patience:2},apply:(e,o)=>{_(e,"patience",1),Qo(e,o,["iq","perimeterD"],{patience:1})}},{key:"music",text:a("Play the loudest music in the locker room","在更衣室放最大声的音乐","在休息室放最大聲的音樂"),lean:{charisma:1,creativity:1},apply:(e,o)=>{let n=k(e,.6);ce(e,n?3:-1),Da(e,n,xe(e,"playoff_road.music.ok",[a("Your music drowned out their crowd before every game. The whole team walked out bouncing.","每场比赛前，你的音乐盖过了对方的观众。全队蹦蹦跳跳地走上球场。","每場比賽前，你的音樂蓋過了對方的觀眾。全隊蹦蹦跳跳地走上球場。"),a("You turned the speaker all the way up. Even the quiet veterans were nodding along by tip-off.","你把音箱开到最大。开赛前，连最安静的老将都跟着点头了。","你把音響開到最大。開賽前，連最安靜的老將都跟著點頭了。"),a("Their crowd was loud; your locker room was louder. The team came out of the tunnel already moving.","他们的观众很吵，你们的更衣室更吵。全队从球员通道出来时已经热起来了。","他們的觀眾很吵，你們的休息室更吵。全隊從球員通道出來時已經熱起來了。")]),xe(e,"playoff_road.music.bad",[a("Nobody agreed on the music. Two veterans went to warm up in silence.","没人认同你的音乐，两个老将跑去安安静静地热身了。","沒人認同你的音樂，兩個老將跑去安安靜靜地熱身了。"),a("Your playlist started an argument nobody won. Two veterans put their headphones on and warmed up alone.","你的歌单引发了一场没有赢家的争论。两个老将戴上耳机，自己去热身了。","你的歌單引發了一場沒有贏家的爭論。兩個老將戴上耳機，自己去熱身了。"),a("The music was loud, and so was the complaining. Two veterans took their warm-up out into the quiet hallway.","音乐很吵，抱怨声也不小。两个老将把热身挪到了安静的走廊里。","音樂很吵，抱怨聲也不小。兩個老將把熱身移到了安靜的走廊上。")]),o),Qo(e,o,["finishing","passing"],{charisma:1})}},{key:"home",text:a("Call home before every tip-off","每场开赛前打电话回家","每場開賽前打電話回家"),lean:{empathy:1,patience:1},apply:(e,o)=>{l(e,"relationships",2),Qo(e,o,["passing","iq"],{empathy:1})}}],words:[{early:a("Get to their arena first and shoot alone","最早到他们球馆，一个人投篮","最早到他們球館，一個人投籃"),wave:a("Smile and wave at the boos","对着嘘声微笑挥手","對著噓聲微笑揮手"),steal:a("Just take one game from them","只要从他们手里拿走一场","只要從他們手上拿走一場"),music:a("Turn the locker room music all the way up","把更衣室的音乐开到最大","把休息室的音樂開到最大"),home:a("Phone your family before each game","每场比赛前打给家人","每場比賽前打給家人")},{early:a("Shoot in their gym before anyone else","比谁都早在他们的球馆里投篮","比誰都早在他們的球館裡投籃"),wave:a("Enjoy their crowd and let them see it","享受对方观众的嘘声，还故意让他们看见","享受對方觀眾的噓聲，還故意讓他們看見"),steal:a("One win on the road is enough","客场赢一场就够了","客場贏一場就夠了"),music:a("Bring the loudest playlist you own","带上你最吵的歌单","帶上你最吵的歌單"),home:a("Hear a voice from home before tip-off","开赛前听听家里的声音","開賽前聽聽家裡的聲音")}]},playoff_rival:{answers:[{key:"joke",text:a("Answer with a joke","用一个玩笑回应","用一個玩笑回應"),hint:a("It may not land","不一定有人笑","不一定有人笑"),lean:{charisma:2,creativity:1},apply:(e,o)=>{let n=Js(e);n?(ye(e,3),ce(e,2)):l(e,"reputation",-1),Da(e,n,xe(e,"playoff_rival.joke.ok",[a("You said you were flattered {opp} thought about you so much. The room laughed, and so did your teammates.","你说{opp}这么惦记你，你受宠若惊。全场都笑了，你的队友们也笑了。","你說{opp}這麼惦記你，你受寵若驚。全場都笑了，你的隊友們也笑了。"),a("You said {opp} must watch a lot of your games to know so much about you. The room laughed, and your teammates loudest.","你说{opp}一定看了很多你的比赛，才会这么了解你。全场都笑了，笑得最大声的是你的队友。","你說{opp}一定看了很多你的比賽，才會這麼了解你。全場都笑了，笑得最大聲的是你的隊友。"),a("You offered {opp} a signed photo, since they clearly missed you. The reporters laughed, and your teammates replayed it all week.","你说要送{opp}一张签名照，毕竟他们显然很想你。记者们笑了，你的队友们整周都在重播那一段。","你說要送{opp}一張簽名照，畢竟他們顯然很想你。記者們笑了，你的隊友們整週都在重播那一段。")]),xe(e,"playoff_rival.joke.bad",[a("Your joke fell flat. {opp} fans printed it on a banner.","你的玩笑冷场了。{opp}的球迷把它印在了横幅上。","你的玩笑冷場了。{opp}的球迷把它印在了布條上。"),a("Nobody laughed at your joke. By the next game, {opp} fans were laughing at it instead, on a banner.","你的玩笑没人笑。到下一场，{opp}的球迷倒是笑了：他们把它做成了横幅。","你的玩笑沒人笑。到下一場，{opp}的球迷倒是笑了：他們把它做成了布條。"),a("The joke died in the room. {opp} fans brought it back to life in big letters on a banner.","那个玩笑在发布会上就冷掉了。{opp}的球迷把它用大字印在横幅上，让它重获新生。","那個玩笑在記者會上就冷掉了。{opp}的球迷把它用大字印在布條上，讓它重獲新生。")]),o),Qo(e,o,["three","mid"],{charisma:1})}},{key:"thanks",text:a("Thank them for the motivation","谢谢他们给你的动力","謝謝他們給你的動力"),lean:{patience:1,resilience:1},apply:(e,o)=>{we(e,1),_(e,"resilience",1),Qo(e,o,["perimeterD","mid"],{resilience:1})}},{key:"wall",text:a("Pin their quotes on the locker room wall","把他们的话钉在更衣室墙上","把他們的話釘在休息室牆上"),hint:a("It can fire the team up, or make it tight","可能点燃全队，也可能让大家绷太紧","可能點燃全隊，也可能讓大家繃太緊"),lean:{ambition:1,bravery:1},apply:(e,o)=>{ce(e,3);let n=k(e,.5);Da(e,n,xe(e,"playoff_rival.wall.ok",[a("Every teammate read the wall on the way to the court. They played angry.","每个队友上场前都看了那面墙，打得火气十足。","每個隊友上場前都看了那面牆，打得火氣十足。"),a("Nobody walked past that wall without stopping to read it. The team played with a chip on every shoulder.","没有人经过那面墙时不停下来看一眼。全队都憋着一股气在打。","沒有人經過那面牆時不停下來看一眼。全隊都憋著一股氣在打。"),a("Their words on your wall did what no speech could. Your team came out snarling.","墙上他们的那些话，比任何演讲都管用。你的球队一上场就咬牙切齿。","牆上他們的那些話，比任何演講都管用。你的球隊一上場就咬牙切齒。")]),xe(e,"playoff_rival.wall.bad",[a("The wall made everyone tight. Everyone missed easy ones early on.","那面墙让大家都绷得太紧，开局全队都在丢简单球。","那面牆讓大家都繃得太緊，開局全隊都在丟簡單球。"),a("The quotes on the wall weighed on everyone. The first quarter was full of missed layups.","墙上那些话压在每个人心上。第一节上篮一个接一个没进。","牆上那些話壓在每個人心上。第一節上籃一個接一個沒進。"),a("Your team read the wall, then played like it was watching them. Easy shots rimmed out early.","队友们看完那面墙，打起球来像被它盯着一样。开局简单的球都在筐上弹了出来。","隊友們看完那面牆，打起球來像被它盯著一樣。開局簡單的球都在框上彈了出來。")]),o),Qo(e,o,["finishing","perimeterD"],{bravery:1},n?.3:-.3)}},{key:"turn",text:a("Turn the question back on the reporter","把问题丢回给记者","把問題丟回給記者"),lean:{intelligence:1,creativity:1},apply:(e,o)=>{let n=k(e,ke(e,{intelligence:2,charisma:1}));n?ye(e,2):l(e,"reputation",-1),Da(e,n,xe(e,"playoff_rival.turn.ok",[a("You asked the reporter who he thought would win. He picked you, and the room laughed.","你反问记者觉得谁会赢。他选了你们，全场都笑了。","你反問記者覺得誰會贏。他選了你們，全場都笑了。"),a("You handed the question back: who did he have? He said your team, a little too fast, and the room laughed.","你把问题还给他：他看好谁？他说你们，说得有点太快了，全场都笑了。","你把問題還給他：他看好誰？他說你們，說得有點太快了，全場都笑了。"),a("You asked the reporter for his pick. He went with you, and the clip of his face was everywhere that night.","你请记者说说他的预测。他选了你们，他那一刻的表情当晚传遍了网络。","你請記者說說他的預測。他選了你們，他那一刻的表情當晚傳遍了網路。")]),xe(e,"playoff_rival.turn.bad",[a("You turned the question on the reporter. He did not laugh, and neither did his paper the next morning.","你把问题丢回给记者。他没笑，第二天早上他的报纸也没给你好脸色。","你把問題丟回給記者。他沒笑，隔天早上他的報紙也沒給你好臉色。"),a("You asked the reporter what he thought. He told you, in print, the next morning, and it was not kind.","你反问记者怎么看。第二天早上，他在报纸上告诉了你，而且一点都不客气。","你反問記者怎麼看。隔天早上，他在報紙上告訴了你，而且一點都不客氣。"),a("The reporter did not enjoy having the question handed back. His column the next day enjoyed it even less.","记者不喜欢问题被丢回来。第二天他的专栏写得更不客气。","記者不喜歡問題被丟回來。隔天他的專欄寫得更不客氣。")]),o),Qo(e,o,["iq","passing"],{intelligence:1})}},{key:"raised",text:a("Say you were raised not to talk back","说你从小被教导不要顶嘴","說你從小被教導不要頂嘴"),lean:{empathy:1,honesty:1},apply:(e,o)=>{ye(e,2),l(e,"relationships",1),d(e,xe(e,"playoff_rival.raised.line",[a("Asked about {opp}, you said you were raised not to talk back, then smiled. Back home, your family framed the clip.","被问到{opp}时，你说你从小被教导不要顶嘴，然后笑了笑。家里人把那段视频裱了起来。","被問到{opp}時，你說你從小被教導不要頂嘴，然後笑了笑。家裡人把那段影片裱了起來。"),a("You said your family raised you not to talk back, not even to {opp}. Back home, the family chat played the clip on repeat.","你说家里从小教你不要顶嘴，就算对方是{opp}也一样。家里的群聊把那段视频循环播放。","你說家裡從小教你不要頂嘴，就算對方是{opp}也一樣。家裡的群組把那段影片一直重播。"),a("On {opp}, you only said you were raised better than to talk back, and smiled. It was the quote of the round back home.","谈到{opp}，你只说你从小被教导不要顶嘴，然后笑了笑。在老家，这成了这一轮最热的一句话。","談到{opp}，你只說你從小被教導不要頂嘴，然後笑了笑。在老家，這成了這一輪最熱門的一句話。")]),{opp:o.opp}),Qo(e,o,["perimeterD","interiorD"],{patience:1})}}],words:[{joke:a("Laugh it off with a one-liner","用一句俏皮话笑着带过","用一句俏皮話笑著帶過"),thanks:a("Say thanks: they just gave you fuel","说声谢谢：他们刚给你加满了油","說聲謝謝：他們剛幫你加滿了油"),wall:a("Put their words where the team will see them","把他们的话贴到全队都看得见的地方","把他們的話貼到全隊都看得到的地方"),turn:a("Ask the reporter what he thinks","反问记者怎么看","反問記者怎麼看"),raised:a("Say your family taught you better than that","说家里教过你别这样","說家裡教過你別這樣")},{joke:a("Make the room laugh instead","换个方式，让全场笑出来","換個方式，讓全場笑出來"),thanks:a("Thank them, and mean it","谢谢他们，而且是真心的","謝謝他們，而且是真心的"),wall:a("Save every quote for the locker room","把每句话都留给更衣室","把每句話都留給休息室"),turn:a("Hand the question back with a grin","笑着把问题还回去","笑著把問題還回去"),raised:a("Say you do not talk back, you play back","说你不回嘴，你在场上回应","說你不回嘴，你在場上回應")}]},playoff_matchup:{answers:[{key:"switch",text:a("Switch everything and keep him guessing","全换防，让他猜不透","全換防，讓他猜不透"),lean:{intelligence:1,creativity:1},apply:(e,o)=>{_(e,"creativity",1),Qo(e,o,["perimeterD","iq"],{intelligence:1})}},{key:"deny",text:a("Deny him the ball before he catches it","抢在他前面，不让他接到球","搶在他前面，不讓他接到球"),hint:a("Leave him one back door and he will find it","留一条后门给他，他就会找到","留一條後門給他，他就會找到"),lean:{discipline:1,bravery:1},apply:(e,o)=>{let n=k(e,Bl(se(e,.45,["perimeterD","athleticism"],{discipline:1}),Gh(o,{ath:.6,pm:.4})));n&&ye(e,1),Da(e,n,xe(e,"playoff_matchup.deny.ok",[a("He caught the ball thirty feet from the rim all series and looked tired of it by the end.","整个系列赛他都只能在离篮筐九米外接球，到最后已经一脸厌烦。","整個系列賽他都只能在離籃框九公尺外接球，到最後已經一臉厭煩。"),a("You fronted him on every catch. He spent the series starting his moves far from the rim, and it wore on him.","他每次接球你都抢在前面。整个系列赛他都只能离篮筐很远才开始进攻，越打越疲惫。","他每次接球你都搶在前面。整個系列賽他都只能離籃框很遠才開始進攻，越打越疲憊。"),a("Every pass to him was a fight. By the end of the series he was catching it near half court and sighing.","每一次传球给他都是一场争夺。到系列赛后段，他只能在中场附近接球，然后叹口气。","每一次傳球給他都是一場爭奪。到系列賽後段，他只能在中場附近接球，然後嘆口氣。")]),xe(e,"playoff_matchup.deny.bad",[a("You overplayed him and he cut back door twice in the first five minutes.","你防得太靠前，开场五分钟他就反跑空切了两次。","你防得太靠前，開場五分鐘他就反跑空切了兩次。"),a("You played the passing lane too hard. He went back door, and then again, before five minutes were up.","你对传球路线压得太狠。不到五分钟，他就反跑空切了一次，接着又是一次。","你對傳球路線壓得太狠。不到五分鐘，他就反跑空切了一次，接著又是一次。"),a("You left him one back door, and he found it twice inside the first five minutes.","你给他留了一条后门，开场五分钟里他就找到了两次。","你給他留了一條後門，開場五分鐘裡他就找到了兩次。")]),o),Qo(e,o,["perimeterD","athleticism"],{discipline:1},n?.5:-.4)}},{key:"line",text:a("Make him earn it at the free-throw line","让他去罚球线上自己挣","讓他去罰球線上自己掙"),hint:a("If he makes them, it backfires","他罚得进的话，就适得其反","他罰得進的話，就適得其反"),lean:{risk:1,bravery:1},apply:(e,o)=>{let n=k(e,Bl(.5,Gh(o,{sh:1})));Da(e,n,xe(e,"playoff_matchup.line.ok",[a("You fouled him hard and early. He went to the line and left points there every night.","你一开始就狠狠犯规。他站上罚球线，每晚都丢掉不少分。","你一開始就狠狠犯規。他站上罰球線，每晚都丟掉不少分。"),a("You made him earn it at the line from the first minute. His free throws let him down night after night.","你从第一分钟起就逼他去罚球线拿分。他的罚球一晚又一晚地不争气。","你從第一分鐘起就逼他去罰球線拿分。他的罰球一晚又一晚地不爭氣。"),a("Early, hard fouls, every night. He went to the line often and walked away from it with less than he should have.","每晚你都早早狠狠地犯规。他常常站上罚球线，拿走的分却比该拿的少。","每晚你都早早狠狠地犯規。他常常站上罰球線，拿走的分卻比該拿的少。")]),xe(e,"playoff_matchup.line.bad",[a("You fouled him every time he moved. He made fourteen free throws in one night.","他一动你就犯规。结果他一个晚上罚进了十四球。","他一動你就犯規。結果他一個晚上罰進了十四球。"),a("Every time he moved you fouled him, and he made you pay: fourteen free throws in a single night.","他每动一下你就犯规，他也让你付出了代价：一个晚上罚进十四球。","他每動一下你就犯規，他也讓你付出了代價：一個晚上罰進十四球。"),a("Your plan sent him to the line. He liked it there: fourteen made free throws in one game.","你的计划把他送上了罚球线。他很喜欢那里：一场比赛罚进了十四球。","你的計畫把他送上了罰球線。他很喜歡那裡：一場比賽罰進了十四球。")]),o),Qo(e,o,["interiorD","perimeterD"],{bravery:1},n?.35:-.35)}},{key:"film",text:a("Study every shot he took this season","研究他这个赛季的每一次出手","研究他這個賽季的每一次出手"),lean:{intelligence:1,discipline:1},apply:(e,o)=>{we(e,1),Qo(e,o,["iq","perimeterD"],{intelligence:1})}},{key:"young",text:a("Give the job to a young defender and coach him through it","把任务交给年轻防守者，你在旁边带他","把任務交給年輕防守者，你在旁邊帶他"),lean:{empathy:2},apply:(e,o)=>{let n=k(e,.5);ce(e,n?4:1),Da(e,n,xe(e,"playoff_matchup.young.ok",[a("The young defender held him under his average. You hugged the kid at the buzzer.","那个年轻防守者把他限制在场均以下。终场哨响时你抱住了这孩子。","那個年輕防守者把他限制在場均以下。終場哨響時你抱住了這孩子。"),a("You trusted the young defender with him, and the kid kept him below his usual numbers. You were first to reach him at the buzzer.","你把他交给了那个年轻防守者，这孩子让他打得比平时差。终场哨响时，你第一个冲过去抱住他。","你把他交給了那個年輕防守者，這孩子讓他打得比平時差。終場哨響時，你第一個衝過去抱住他。"),a("The kid you vouched for made their scorer work for every point and kept him under his average. You hugged him at the final buzzer.","你力挺的那个孩子让对方得分手每一分都得来不易，把他压在了场均以下。终场时你抱住了他。","你力挺的那個孩子讓對方得分手每一分都得來不易，把他壓在了場均以下。終場時你抱住了他。")]),xe(e,"playoff_matchup.young.bad",[a("The young defender had a rough start. You took the job back.","那个年轻防守者一开始就被打得很惨，你只好把任务接回来。","那個年輕防守者一開始就被打得很慘，你只好把任務接回來。"),a("The young defender was in over his head from the opening minutes. You took the assignment back and told him there would be other nights.","那个年轻防守者开场没几分钟就招架不住了。你把任务接了回来，告诉他以后还有机会。","那個年輕防守者開場沒幾分鐘就招架不住了。你把任務接了回來，告訴他以後還有機會。"),a("The kid was beaten early and often. You patted him on the back and took the job yourself.","那孩子一开场就被连连打爆。你拍了拍他的背，自己把任务接了过来。","那孩子一開場就被連連打爆。你拍了拍他的背，自己把任務接了過來。")]),o),Qo(e,o,["iq","passing"],{empathy:1},n?.25:-.3)}}],words:[{switch:a("Switch on everything and confuse him","全部换防，搅乱他","全部換防，攪亂他"),deny:a("Keep the ball out of his hands","别让球到他手里","別讓球到他手上"),line:a("Foul him and let him prove it at the line","犯规，让他到罚球线证明自己","犯規，讓他到罰球線證明自己"),film:a("Learn his every habit from the film","从录像里把他的习惯全摸透","從影片裡把他的習慣全摸透"),young:a("Trust a young defender with him","把他交给年轻的防守者","把他交給年輕的防守者")},{switch:a("Show him a new face every trip","每回合都换个人对付他","每回合都換個人對付他"),deny:a("Make him work just to catch it","让他连接球都费劲","讓他連接球都費勁"),line:a("Send him to the line, not the rim","把他送上罚球线，别让他到篮下","把他送上罰球線，別讓他到籃下"),film:a("Watch all his shots until you know them","把他的出手看到烂熟","把他的出手看到爛熟"),young:a("Let the kid guard him while you coach","让小伙子去防，你在一旁指点","讓小夥子去防，你在一旁指點")}]},playoff_rest:{answers:[{key:"yoga",text:a("Try the yoga class the physio keeps pushing","去上理疗师一直推荐的瑜伽课","去上物理治療師一直推薦的瑜伽課"),lean:{curiosity:1,patience:1},apply:(e,o)=>{let n=k(e,.6);n?l(e,"health",2):ce(e,1),Da(e,n,xe(e,"playoff_rest.yoga.ok",[a("Four days of yoga, and your hamstrings felt twenty years younger.","上了四天瑜伽，你的腿后肌像年轻了二十岁。","上了四天瑜伽，你的腿後肌像年輕了二十歲。"),a("You spent the four days on a yoga mat. You could touch your toes for the first time since school.","那四天你都待在瑜伽垫上。你从上学以后第一次能摸到脚趾了。","那四天你都待在瑜伽墊上。你從上學以後第一次能摸到腳趾了。"),a("Yoga every morning for four days. Your body came back loose and quiet, and your back stopped complaining.","连续四天每天早上做瑜伽。身体变得放松、舒服，背也不再抗议了。","連續四天每天早上做瑜伽。身體變得放鬆、舒服，背也不再抗議了。")]),xe(e,"playoff_rest.yoga.bad",[a("You fell asleep in the last pose and snored. The physio filmed it for the team chat.","你在最后一个动作里睡着还打起了呼。理疗师录下来发到了队群里。","你在最後一個動作裡睡著還打起了呼。物理治療師錄下來傳到了隊上的群組。"),a("You lasted until the final pose, then fell asleep on the mat. The team chat had the video before you woke up.","你撑到了最后一个动作，然后在垫子上睡着了。你还没醒，视频已经在队群里了。","你撐到了最後一個動作，然後在墊子上睡著了。你還沒醒，影片已經在隊上的群組裡了。"),a("The yoga mostly taught you how to nap. Your snoring became the team’s new favourite ringtone.","瑜伽主要教会了你怎么打盹。你的呼噜声成了全队最喜欢的新铃声。","瑜伽主要教會了你怎麼打瞌睡。你的打呼聲成了全隊最喜歡的新鈴聲。")]),o),Qo(e,o,["athleticism","iq"],{patience:1})}},{key:"fly",text:a("Fly home for one day to see family","飞回家待一天，看看家人","飛回家待一天，看看家人"),lean:{empathy:2},apply:(e,o)=>{l(e,"relationships",3),we(e,-1),Qo(e,o,["passing","iq"],{empathy:1})}},{key:"film",text:a("Watch every game they played this season","把他们本季的比赛全看一遍","把他們本季的比賽全看一遍"),lean:{intelligence:1,discipline:1},apply:(e,o)=>{he(e,2),Qo(e,o,["iq","perimeterD"],{intelligence:1})}},{key:"golf",text:a("Play golf to clear your head","去打高尔夫放空一下","去打高爾夫放空一下"),lean:{risk:1,patience:1},apply:(e,o)=>{let n=k(e,.5);l(e,"happiness",n?3:-1),Da(e,n,xe(e,"playoff_rest.golf.ok",[a("Eighteen holes in the sun, and you came back with a clear head.","在阳光下打了十八洞，你回来时脑子清爽多了。","在陽光下打了十八洞，你回來時腦袋清爽多了。"),a("A long day on the golf course, nobody talking basketball. You came back calm.","在高尔夫球场待了一整天，没人聊篮球。你回来时心平气和。","在高爾夫球場待了一整天，沒人聊籃球。你回來時心平氣和。"),a("You played eighteen holes badly and happily. The series felt smaller when you got back.","你打了十八洞，打得很烂，但很开心。回来时，系列赛好像没那么沉重了。","你打了十八洞，打得很爛，但很開心。回來時，系列賽好像沒那麼沉重了。")]),xe(e,"playoff_rest.golf.bad",[a("You lost eight balls in the lake and came back angrier than you left.","你往湖里打丢了八颗球，回来时比出门前还火大。","你往湖裡打掉了八顆球，回來時比出門前還火大。"),a("Golf was meant to calm you down. The lake took eight balls and your good mood with them.","打高尔夫本来是为了放松。结果湖吞掉了八颗球，顺便把你的好心情也吞了。","打高爾夫本來是為了放鬆。結果湖吞掉了八顆球，順便把你的好心情也吞了。"),a("Eight balls in the water and one club thrown after them. You came back in a worse mood than when you left.","八颗球掉进水里，还扔下去一根球杆。你回来时心情比出门时还糟。","八顆球掉進水裡，還丟下去一根球桿。你回來時心情比出門時還糟。")]),o),Qo(e,o,["mid","three"],{patience:1})}},{key:"vets",text:a("Ask the veterans how they got through it","向老将请教他们怎么熬过来的","向老將請教他們怎麼熬過來的"),lean:{empathy:1,curiosity:1},apply:(e,o)=>{ce(e,2),_(e,"patience",1),Qo(e,o,["iq","passing"],{curiosity:1,patience:1})}}],words:[{yoga:a("Give the physio’s yoga a go","试试理疗师的瑜伽","試試物理治療師的瑜伽"),fly:a("Squeeze in a day at home","挤出一天回家","擠出一天回家"),film:a("Binge their whole season on film","把他们整季的录像一口气看完","把他們整季的影片一口氣看完"),golf:a("Get out on a golf course","去高尔夫球场走走","去高爾夫球場走走"),vets:a("Sit with the veterans and listen","跟老将坐下来，听他们说","跟老將坐下來，聽他們說")},{yoga:a("Stretch it out on a yoga mat","在瑜伽垫上拉伸放松","在瑜伽墊上伸展放鬆"),fly:a("Go home for a night and come straight back","回家住一晚，马上回来","回家住一晚，馬上回來"),film:a("Learn their season by heart","把对手这一季的比赛看到倒背如流","把對手這一季的比賽看到倒背如流"),golf:a("Swap the gym for eighteen holes","把健身房换成十八洞","把健身房換成十八洞"),vets:a("Ask the old hands for their secrets","向老球员讨教秘诀","向老球員討教祕訣")}]},playoff_family:{answers:[{key:"practice",text:a("Bring them to watch practice","带他们来看训练","帶他們來看練球"),lean:{charisma:1,empathy:1},apply:(e,o)=>{let n=k(e,.6);l(e,"relationships",2),n?ce(e,2):he(e,-2),Da(e,n,a("Your teammates adopted your family for an afternoon. Someone taught them the team handshake.","队友们把你的家人当成自己家人，陪了一下午，还有人教他们球队的击掌暗号。","隊友們把你的家人當成自己家人，陪了一下午，還有人教他們球隊的擊掌暗號。"),a("The coach did not love having visitors at practice. He said so, politely, twice.","教练不太喜欢训练时有外人在场。他客气地说了两遍。","教練不太喜歡練球時有外人在場。他客氣地說了兩遍。"),o),Qo(e,o,["passing","iq"],{charisma:1,empathy:1})}},{key:"shoot",text:a("Take the youngest to the empty arena to shoot","带家里最小的去空球馆投篮","帶家裡最小的去空球館投籃"),lean:{empathy:2},apply:(e,o)=>{l(e,"relationships",3),l(e,"happiness",1),Qo(e,o,["three","iq"],{empathy:1})}},{key:"cook",text:a("Let them cook your pregame meal","让他们给你做赛前餐","讓他們幫你做賽前餐"),lean:{empathy:1,patience:1},apply:(e,o)=>{let n=k(e,.6);l(e,"relationships",2),we(e,n?1:-1),Da(e,n,a("It tasted like home, and you played like it.","那是家的味道，你打得也像在家一样。","那是家的味道，你打得也像在家一樣。"),a("They cooked enough for a wedding, and you ate it all. You felt it in your legs for a half.","他们做的分量够办一场婚宴，你全吃光了。上半场你的腿都是沉的。","他們做的份量夠辦一場婚宴，你全吃光了。上半場你的腿都是沉的。"),o),Qo(e,o,["finishing","iq"],{empathy:1})}},{key:"stories",text:a("Ask them for the old stories about you as a kid","请他们讲讲你小时候的老故事","請他們講講你小時候的老故事"),lean:{empathy:1,resilience:1},apply:(e,o)=>{l(e,"happiness",2),l(e,"relationships",1),d(e,a("They told the story of your first basket again. You laughed until you forgot {opp} for an evening.","他们又讲起你投进第一球的故事。你笑到整个晚上都忘了{opp}。","他們又講起你投進第一球的故事。你笑到整個晚上都忘了{opp}。"),{opp:o.opp}),Qo(e,o,["mid","passing"],{resilience:1})}},{key:"hotel",text:a("Move them into your hotel to see them every day","让他们住进你的酒店，天天见面","讓他們住進你的飯店，天天見面"),lean:{empathy:1,risk:1},apply:(e,o)=>{let n=k(e,.5);l(e,"relationships",n?3:2),n?l(e,"happiness",1):we(e,-1),Da(e,n,a("Breakfast with your family every morning. You went to every game with a full heart.","每天早上都和家人一起吃早餐。你每场比赛都带着满满的幸福感上场。","每天早上都和家人一起吃早餐。你每場比賽都帶著滿滿的幸福感上場。"),a("Breakfast every morning turned into a two-hour family meeting about your minutes.","每天的早餐都变成了两小时的家庭会议，主题是你的上场时间。","每天的早餐都變成了兩小時的家庭會議，主題是你的上場時間。"),o),Qo(e,o,["athleticism","passing"],{empathy:1})}}],words:[{practice:a("Let them sit in on practice","让他们来看一次训练","讓他們來看一次練球"),shoot:a("Shoot around with the youngest in the empty arena","和最小的在空球馆里投投篮","和最小的在空球館裡投投籃"),cook:a("Eat a home-cooked meal before the game","赛前吃一顿家里做的饭","賽前吃一頓家裡做的飯"),stories:a("Let them tell the stories from when you were small","让他们讲你小时候的事","讓他們講你小時候的事"),hotel:a("Book them rooms down the hall from yours","在你房间那层给他们订房","在你房間那層幫他們訂房")},{practice:a("Show them what a playoff practice looks like","让他们看看季后赛的训练是什么样","讓他們看看季後賽的練球是什麼樣"),shoot:a("Take the little one to shoot when the arena is empty","趁球馆没人，带小家伙去投篮","趁球館沒人，帶小傢伙去投籃"),cook:a("Ask for the dish you grew up on","点一道你从小吃到大的菜","點一道你從小吃到大的菜"),stories:a("Spend an evening on old family stories","用一个晚上聊家里的老故事","用一個晚上聊家裡的老故事"),hotel:a("Keep them close, in the same hotel","让他们住同一家酒店，离你近点","讓他們住同一家飯店，離你近一點")}]},playoff_finals:{answers:[{key:"dirty",text:a("Do the dirty work: boards, screens, loose balls","干脏活：篮板、掩护、地板球","做苦工：籃板、掩護、地板球"),lean:{discipline:1,resilience:1},apply:(e,o)=>{he(e,3),Qo(e,o,["rebounding","athleticism","interiorD"],{resilience:1,discipline:1})}},{key:"reads",text:a("Run the offence and make every right read","组织进攻，每次都做出正确判断","組織進攻，每次都做出正確判斷"),lean:{intelligence:2},apply:(e,o)=>{ce(e,2),Qo(e,o,["passing","iq","handling"],{intelligence:1})}},{key:"park",text:a("Play it like the park at twelve: for fun","像十二岁在公园打球那样：打得开心就好","像十二歲在公園打球那樣：打得開心就好"),hint:a("Fun is hard to find with a title at stake","冠军近在眼前，想打得开心可不容易","冠軍近在眼前，想打得開心可不容易"),lean:{creativity:1,patience:1},apply:(e,o)=>{let n=k(e,ke(e,{creativity:1,resilience:1}));n&&l(e,"happiness",2),Da(e,n,xe(e,"playoff_finals.park.ok",[a("You smiled through every warm-up of the Finals. The pressure slid right off you.","总决赛每次热身你都笑着。压力对你好像一点作用都没有。","總冠軍賽每次熱身你都笑著。壓力對你好像一點作用都沒有。"),a("You played the Finals warm-ups like a Sunday at the park. Whatever weight everyone else felt, you did not.","你把总决赛的热身打得像周日在公园打球。别人感受到的压力，你一点都没有。","你把總冠軍賽的熱身打得像週日在公園打球。別人感受到的壓力，你一點都沒有。"),a("The biggest series of your life, and you were laughing in the layup line. The nerves never found you.","这是你人生中最重要的系列赛，你却在上篮热身的队伍里笑。紧张从来没找上你。","這是你人生中最重要的系列賽，你卻在上籃熱身的隊伍裡笑。緊張從來沒找上你。")]),xe(e,"playoff_finals.park.bad",[a("Playing for fun was a hard sell with the trophy in the building. You looked lost early on.","奖杯就摆在球馆里，还想打得开心，太难了。开局你看起来很迷茫。","獎盃就擺在球館裡，還想打得開心，太難了。開局你看起來很迷惘。"),a("You tried to keep it light, but the trophy sat there in the building. In the first games you played like you were looking for it.","你想放轻松，可奖杯就摆在那里。前几场你打得像是在找它。","你想放輕鬆，可獎盃就擺在那裡。前幾場你打得像是在找它。"),a("Fun is hard to find in the Finals. You smiled in warm-ups and wandered through the first quarters.","总决赛里很难找到乐趣。热身时你还在笑，前几场的第一节却打得魂不守舍。","總冠軍賽裡很難找到樂趣。熱身時你還在笑，前幾場的第一節卻打得魂不守舍。")]),o),Qo(e,o,["handling","finishing"],{creativity:1},n?.3:-.4)}},{key:"offline",text:a("Delete every app until it is over","打完之前删掉所有应用","打完之前刪掉所有App"),lean:{discipline:2},apply:(e,o)=>{l(e,"happiness",1),ye(e,-1),Qo(e,o,["three","mid"],{discipline:1})}},{key:"elder",text:a("Ask the oldest man on the team to speak before the first game","请队里年纪最大的人在首场前讲几句","請隊上年紀最大的人在首場前講幾句"),lean:{empathy:1,patience:1},apply:(e,o)=>{let n=k(e,.5);ce(e,n?5:1),Da(e,n,xe(e,"playoff_finals.elder.ok",[a("The old man spoke for two minutes about his first season. Nobody said a word after; nobody needed to.","老将讲了两分钟自己的第一个赛季。之后没人说话，也不需要说。","老將講了兩分鐘自己的第一個賽季。之後沒人說話，也不需要說。"),a("The veteran talked about his first season, and the bus rides nobody remembers. When he stopped, the room was ready.","老将讲起了他的第一个赛季，讲那些没人记得的大巴旅程。他讲完时，全队都准备好了。","老將講起了他的第一個賽季，講那些沒人記得的巴士旅程。他講完時，全隊都準備好了。"),a("Two minutes from the oldest man on the team, about where he started. It was the quietest locker room of the season, and the readiest.","队里年纪最大的人讲了两分钟，讲他从哪里起步。那是整个赛季最安静、也最有斗志的更衣室。","隊上年紀最大的人講了兩分鐘，講他從哪裡起步。那是整個賽季最安靜、也最有鬥志的休息室。")]),xe(e,"playoff_finals.elder.bad",[a("The old man got emotional halfway through, and nobody knew where to look.","老将讲到一半情绪上来了，大家都不知道眼睛该往哪看。","老將講到一半情緒上來了，大家都不知道眼睛該往哪看。"),a("The veteran started strong and then his voice cracked. Everyone suddenly found their shoelaces very interesting.","老将开头讲得很有力，接着声音就哽咽了。大家突然都对自己的鞋带产生了浓厚兴趣。","老將開頭講得很有力，接著聲音就哽咽了。大家突然都對自己的鞋帶產生了濃厚興趣。"),a("Halfway through his speech the old man had to stop. The silence after was the long, awkward kind.","讲到一半，老将不得不停下来。接下来是那种漫长又尴尬的沉默。","講到一半，老將不得不停下來。接下來是那種漫長又尷尬的沉默。")]),o),Qo(e,o,["iq","passing"],{empathy:1},n?.2:-.2)}}],words:[{dirty:a("Be the one who does the work nobody sees","去做那些没人看得见的苦活","去做那些沒人看得見的苦工"),reads:a("Make the right play, every trip","每回合都做对的选择","每回合都做對的選擇"),park:a("Play like a kid in the park again","像个在公园打球的孩子一样去打","像個在公園打球的孩子一樣去打"),offline:a("Go silent online until it is done","打完之前，网上一个字都不看","打完之前，網路上一個字都不看"),elder:a("Hand the first words to the team’s oldest player","把开场发言交给队里最老的球员","把開場發言交給隊上最老的球員")},{dirty:a("Win the plays that never make the highlights","赢下那些永远上不了集锦的回合","贏下那些永遠上不了精華的回合"),reads:a("Be the brain of the offence","当进攻的大脑","當進攻的大腦"),park:a("Forget the trophy and just enjoy it","忘掉奖杯，好好享受","忘掉獎盃，好好享受"),offline:a("Put the phone in a drawer for two weeks","把手机锁进抽屉两个星期","把手機鎖進抽屜兩個星期"),elder:a("Let the veteran speak first","让老将先开口","讓老將先開口")},{dirty:a("Make every rebound and screen your job","每个篮板、每次掩护都揽下来","每個籃板、每次掩護都攬下來"),reads:a("Read the defence and find the open man","读懂防守，找到空位的人","讀懂防守，找到空檔的人"),park:a("Bring the fun of the park to the Finals","把公园里的快乐带进总决赛","把公園裡的快樂帶進總冠軍賽"),offline:a("Shut out the noise, every bit of it","把所有噪音都挡在外面","把所有雜音都擋在外面"),elder:a("Ask the old hand to say a few words","请老将说几句","請老將說幾句")}]},staff_playoffs:{answers:[{key:"deep",text:a("Play ten men and wear them down","十人轮换，把对手拖垮","十人輪換，把對手拖垮"),lean:{patience:1,empathy:1},apply:e=>{ht(e,3),l(e,"happiness",1),uh(e,{patience:1,empathy:1})}},{key:"film",text:a("Give the players a film session on every rival","给球员们把每个对手的录像都过一遍","幫球員們把每個對手的影片都過一遍"),lean:{intelligence:2},apply:e=>{l(e,"happiness",-1),_(e,"intelligence",1),uh(e,{intelligence:2,discipline:1})}},{key:"threes",text:a("Push the pace and live by the three","提速，靠三分吃饭","提速，靠三分吃飯"),hint:a("Live by it, die by it","成也三分，败也三分","成也三分，敗也三分"),lean:{risk:2},apply:e=>{let o=k(e,Pe(e,.45,{risk:1,creativity:1}));Da(e,o,xe(e,"staff_playoffs.threes.ok",[a("The threes fell all week. The other bench kept looking at the ceiling, as if the rim were the problem.","那一周三分球一直进。对方替补席一直盯着天花板，好像问题出在篮筐上。","那一週三分球一直進。對方板凳區一直盯著天花板，好像問題出在籃框上。"),a("Your shooters let it fly and it kept going in. The other coach spent the week shaking his head.","你的射手们大胆出手，球一直进。对方教练摇了一整周的头。","你的射手們大膽出手，球一直進。對方教練搖了一整週的頭。"),a("You told them to shoot every open three, and they made enough to break the other side’s plan.","你让他们空位三分照投不误，他们投进的球多到打乱了对方的部署。","你讓他們空檔三分照投不誤，他們投進的球多到打亂了對方的部署。")]),xe(e,"staff_playoffs.threes.bad",[a("The threes stopped falling the night the playoffs began.","季后赛开打那晚，三分球就不进了。","季後賽開打那晚，三分球就不進了。"),a("All season the threes went in. On the first night of the playoffs, they forgot how.","整个赛季三分都很准。季后赛第一晚，它们好像忘了怎么进。","整個賽季三分都很準。季後賽第一晚，它們好像忘了怎麼進。"),a("You lived by the three, and in the playoffs the rim stopped cooperating.","你靠三分球吃饭，可到了季后赛，篮筐不再配合了。","你靠三分球吃飯，可到了季後賽，籃框不再配合了。")])),uh(e,{risk:1,bravery:1},o?.6:-.5)}},{key:"young",text:a("Give a young player a bigger role","给一个年轻球员更多戏份","給一個年輕球員更多戲份"),lean:{bravery:1,creativity:1},apply:e=>{let o=k(e,.5);ht(e,2),Da(e,o,xe(e,"staff_playoffs.young.ok",[a("The young player you trusted hit the biggest shot of his life.","你信任的那个年轻球员投进了他这辈子最关键的一球。","你信任的那個年輕球員投進了他這輩子最關鍵的一球。"),a("You put the kid in when it mattered, and he made the shot he will tell his grandchildren about.","在最关键的时候你把那孩子放上场，他投进了一球，够他跟孙子讲一辈子。","在最關鍵的時候你把那孩子放上場，他投進了一球，夠他跟孫子講一輩子。"),a("Everyone asked why the young player was on the floor. Then he hit the biggest shot of his life, and nobody asked again.","大家都在问为什么让那个年轻球员上场。然后他投进了他这辈子最关键的一球，再也没人问了。","大家都在問為什麼讓那個年輕球員上場。然後他投進了他這輩子最關鍵的一球，再也沒人問了。")]),xe(e,"staff_playoffs.young.bad",[a("The young player you trusted froze under the lights. You pulled him after one quarter.","你信任的那个年轻球员在聚光灯下僵住了。一节之后你就把他换下。","你信任的那個年輕球員在聚光燈下僵住了。一節之後你就把他換下。"),a("The lights were too bright for the young player you trusted. After one quarter you sat him and put an arm around him.","你信任的那个年轻球员扛不住大场面。一节之后你让他坐下，搂了搂他的肩膀。","你信任的那個年輕球員扛不住大場面。一節之後你讓他坐下，摟了摟他的肩膀。"),a("The kid you gave the minutes to could not find his feet. One quarter, and you had to take him out.","你给了上场时间的那个孩子一直找不到状态。打了一节，你就只好把他换下来。","你給了上場時間的那個孩子一直找不到狀態。打了一節，你就只好把他換下來。")])),uh(e,{bravery:1,creativity:1},o?.35:-.35)}},{key:"routine",text:a("Keep every routine exactly as in the season","一切作息都跟常规赛一模一样","一切作息都跟例行賽一模一樣"),lean:{discipline:2},apply:e=>{_(e,"discipline",1),uh(e,{discipline:2,patience:1})}}],words:[{deep:a("Use the whole bench and run them ragged","用满整条板凳，把他们拖垮","用滿整條板凳，把他們拖垮"),film:a("Hand out a film study on every opponent","每个对手都准备一份录像分析","每個對手都準備一份影片分析"),threes:a("Shoot threes and play fast","多投三分，打快节奏","多投三分，打快節奏"),young:a("Trust a young player with big minutes","让一个年轻人打关键时间","讓一個年輕人打關鍵時間"),routine:a("Change nothing from the regular season","和常规赛相比什么都不变","和例行賽相比什麼都不變")},{deep:a("Go ten deep and wear them out","十人深度轮换，耗死他们","十人深度輪換，耗死他們"),film:a("Bury the players in scouting tape","让球员埋头看球探录像","讓球員埋頭看球探影片"),threes:a("Let it fly from deep","放手从外线开火","放手從外線開火"),young:a("Hand a youngster a real role","给年轻人一个真正的角色","給年輕人一個真正的角色"),routine:a("Same practices, same meals, same bus times","一样的训练、一样的伙食、一样的发车时间","一樣的練球、一樣的伙食、一樣的發車時間")}]},staff_playoff_speech:{answers:[{key:"story",text:a("Tell them about the night you lost a final","跟他们讲你输掉一场决赛的那个晚上","跟他們講你輸掉一場決賽的那個晚上"),lean:{honesty:1,empathy:1},apply:e=>{let o=k(e,ke(e,{charisma:1,honesty:1}));o&&ht(e,3),Da(e,o,a("You told them about the night you lost a final. The room went silent, then the captain stood up first.","你讲了自己输掉决赛的那个晚上。屋里安静下来，然后队长第一个站了起来。","你講了自己輸掉決賽的那個晚上。屋裡安靜下來，然後隊長第一個站了起來。"),a("The story came out longer and sadder than you meant. Someone yawned.","这个故事讲得比你预想的更长更伤感，有人打了个哈欠。","這個故事講得比你預想的更長更感傷，有人打了個哈欠。")),uh(e,{honesty:1,charisma:1},o?.3:-.2)}},{key:"video",text:a("Show a video of messages from their families","放一段他们家人的打气视频","放一段他們家人的打氣影片"),hint:a("If the laptop cooperates","前提是笔记本电脑别掉链子","前提是筆電別出包"),lean:{empathy:2,creativity:1},apply:e=>{let o=k(e,.6);Da(e,o,a("Half the room was crying, and the other half was pretending not to.","一半的人在哭，另一半在假装没哭。","一半的人在哭，另一半在假裝沒哭。"),a("The video would not play. You hummed in front of the team while an assistant fixed the laptop.","视频怎么都放不出来。助理教练修电脑的时候，你只好站在全队面前哼歌。","影片怎麼都放不出來。助理教練修電腦的時候，你只好站在全隊面前哼歌。")),l(e,"happiness",o?2:-1),uh(e,{empathy:1,creativity:1},o?.3:-.3)}},{key:"board",text:a("Say nothing and write one word on the board","一句不说，只在白板上写一个字","一句不說，只在白板上寫一個字"),lean:{creativity:1,patience:1},apply:e=>{_(e,"creativity",1),uh(e,{creativity:1,patience:1})}},{key:"trip",text:a("Promise a team trip if they win it all","承诺夺冠就请全队去旅行","承諾奪冠就請全隊去旅行"),hint:a("You pay if they do","他们做到了，你就得掏钱","他們做到了，你就得掏錢"),lean:{charisma:1,risk:1},apply:e=>{uh(e,{charisma:1,risk:1},.05),YXe(e)&&(me(e,-ve(e)*.3,"spent"),l(e,"happiness",3),d(e,a("You paid for the team trip you had promised. Worth every cent.","你兑现承诺，掏钱请全队去旅行。每一分钱都值。","你兌現承諾，掏錢請全隊去旅行。每一分錢都值得。")))}},{key:"music",text:a("Let the players pick the music and dance","让球员们选歌跳舞","讓球員們選歌跳舞"),lean:{charisma:1,empathy:1},apply:e=>{ht(e,3),l(e,"happiness",1),uh(e,{charisma:1,empathy:1})}}],words:[{story:a("Tell them about the final you lost","讲讲你输掉的那场决赛","講講你輸掉的那場決賽"),video:a("Play them messages from home","放家人录的打气话给他们看","放家人錄的打氣話給他們看"),board:a("Write one word on the board and leave","在白板上写一个字就走","在白板上寫一個字就走"),trip:a("Put a team trip on the line","拿全队旅行当奖励","拿全隊旅行當獎勵"),music:a("Turn the music up and let them dance","把音乐开大，让他们跳","把音樂開大，讓他們跳")},{story:a("Share the loss that still keeps you up","说说那场至今让你睡不着的失利","說說那場至今讓你睡不著的失利"),video:a("Surprise them with a video from their families","用家人的视频给他们一个惊喜","用家人的影片給他們一個驚喜"),board:a("Let one word on the whiteboard speak","让白板上的一个字替你说话","讓白板上的一個字替你說話"),trip:a("Promise them a trip for the trophy","许诺拿到奖杯就去旅行","許諾拿到獎盃就去旅行"),music:a("Make it a dance party, not a speech","不讲话，改开舞会","不講話，改開舞會")}]},staff_playoff_injury:{answers:[{key:"short",text:a("Bring him off the bench for short spells","让他替补出场，打短时间","讓他替補出場，打短時間"),lean:{patience:1,intelligence:1},apply:e=>{_(e,"patience",1),uh(e,{patience:1,intelligence:1},.05)}},{key:"film",text:a("Have the team study how to win without him","让全队研究没有他怎么赢","讓全隊研究沒有他怎麼贏"),lean:{intelligence:2},apply:e=>{l(e,"happiness",-1),uh(e,{intelligence:2,discipline:1})}},{key:"decoy",text:a("Start him as a decoy and run plays away from him","让他首发当诱饵，战术都往别处打","讓他先發當誘餌，戰術都往別處打"),hint:a("Clever, until they see through it","很聪明，但对手迟早会看穿","很聰明，但對手遲早會看穿"),lean:{creativity:2,risk:1},apply:e=>{let o=k(e,Pe(e,.45,{creativity:1,intelligence:1}));Da(e,o,a("The other side sent two at your decoy all night, and everyone else got open shots.","对方整晚都包夹你的诱饵，其他人都拿到了空位投篮。","對方整晚都包夾你的誘餌，其他人都拿到了空檔投籃。"),a("They worked out the decoy by the second quarter and stopped guarding him.","第二节他们就看穿了诱饵，干脆不防他了。","第二節他們就看穿了誘餌，乾脆不防他了。")),uh(e,{creativity:1,intelligence:1},o?.4:-.4)}},{key:"next",text:a("Build the plan around the next man up","围绕顶上来的人重新排战术","圍繞頂上來的人重新排戰術"),lean:{empathy:1,discipline:1},apply:e=>{ht(e,4),l(e,"happiness",1),uh(e,{discipline:1,empathy:1},-.15)}},{key:"secret",text:a("Keep your plans for him secret until tip-off","开赛前对他的安排保密","開賽前對他的安排保密"),hint:a("Secrets leak","秘密总会走漏","祕密總會走漏"),lean:{intelligence:1,risk:1},apply:e=>{let o=k(e,.5);o||l(e,"reputation",-1),Da(e,o,a("Nobody outside the building knew your plan until the ball went up. The other bench spent the first quarter guessing.","直到跳球，外面没人知道你的安排。对方板凳席整个第一节都在猜。","直到跳球，外面沒人知道你的安排。對方板凳區整個第一節都在猜。"),a("Your plan was in the newspaper the next morning. Someone in the building talks too much.","第二天早上你的安排就上了报纸。球队里有人嘴太快。","隔天早上你的安排就上了報紙。球隊裡有人嘴太快。")),uh(e,{intelligence:1,risk:1},o?.25:-.25)}}],words:[{short:a("Use him in short bursts off the bench","让他替补上来打几段短时间","讓他替補上來打幾段短時間"),film:a("Show the team how to win without him","教全队没有他也能赢","教全隊沒有他也能贏"),decoy:a("Use him as a decoy and attack elsewhere","拿他当诱饵，从别处进攻","拿他當誘餌，從別處進攻"),next:a("Make it the backup’s moment","让替补成为主角","讓替補成為主角"),secret:a("Tell nobody what you will do with him","你会怎么用他，谁都不说","你會怎麼用他，誰都不說")},{short:a("Ration his minutes, a few at a time","一次给他几分钟，省着用","一次給他幾分鐘，省著用"),film:a("Prepare the team to play without him","让全队做好没有他的准备","讓全隊做好沒有他的準備"),decoy:a("Put him out there to draw the defence","派他上场吸引防守","派他上場吸引防守"),next:a("Plan around whoever steps in","围绕顶替他的人做计划","圍繞頂替他的人做計畫"),secret:a("Keep the plan a mystery until tip-off","开赛前一直卖关子","開賽前一直賣關子")}]},bx_role_out:{answers:[{key:"guard",text:a("Take his defensive job too","连他的防守任务也接过来","連他的防守任務也接過來"),hint:a("Your legs may not last","你的腿不一定撑得住","你的腿不一定撐得住"),lean:{discipline:1,bravery:1},apply:(e,o)=>{let n=k(e,se(e,.5,[LQ(e)],{discipline:1}));n?(he(e,4),ec(e,.1)):(he(e,1),we(e,-1)),Da(e,n,xe(e,"bx_role_out.guard.ok",[a("You took on {mate}’s defensive job as well. Their best scorer had a quiet few weeks.","你连{mate}的防守任务也接了过来。对方的头号得分手安静了好几周。","你連{mate}的防守任務也接了過來。對方的頭號得分手安靜了好幾週。"),a("With {mate} out, you took the other side’s best scorer every night, and most nights he went quiet.","{mate}缺阵期间，每晚都由你去盯对方的头号得分手，大多数晚上他都哑火了。","{mate}缺陣期間，每晚都由你去盯對方的頭號得分手，大多數晚上他都啞火了。"),a("You did your job and {mate}’s on defence. The scorers you met in those weeks had nights they would rather forget.","防守端你一人干了自己和{mate}两份活。那几周碰上你的得分手，都打出了一场只想赶快忘掉的比赛。","防守端你一人做了自己和{mate}兩份工作。那幾週碰上你的得分手，都打出了一場只想趕快忘掉的比賽。")]),xe(e,"bx_role_out.guard.bad",[a("You took on {mate}’s defensive job as well, and ran out of legs by every fourth quarter.","你连{mate}的防守任务也接了过来，结果每场到第四节都跑不动了。","你連{mate}的防守任務也接了過來，結果每場到第四節都跑不動了。"),a("Guarding for yourself and for {mate} was too much. Every fourth quarter you were running on empty.","同时扛下自己和{mate}的防守任务实在太累。每到第四节你都没油了。","同時扛下自己和{mate}的防守任務實在太累。每到第四節你都沒油了。"),a("You took {mate}’s defensive job on top of your own. The first three quarters went fine; the fourth never did.","你在自己的任务之外又接下了{mate}的防守任务。前三节都还好，第四节从来都撑不住。","你在自己的任務之外又接下了{mate}的防守任務。前三節都還好，第四節從來都撐不住。")]),o)}},{key:"visit",text:a("Keep {mate} close to the team while he is out","他缺阵期间，让{mate}和球队保持联系","他缺陣期間，讓{mate}和球隊保持聯繫"),lean:{empathy:2},apply:(e,o)=>{ce(e,3),_(e,"empathy",1),d(e,xe(e,"bx_role_out.visit.line",[a("You sat with {mate} at every home game while he was out. He came back hungry.","{mate}缺阵期间，每个主场你都坐在他旁边陪他。他回来时斗志满满。","{mate}缺陣期間，每個主場你都坐在他旁邊陪他。他回來時鬥志滿滿。"),a("You kept {mate} company at every home game while he was out. He came back with something to prove.","{mate}缺阵期间，每个主场你都陪着他。他回来时憋着一股劲要证明自己。","{mate}缺陣期間，每個主場你都陪著他。他回來時憋著一股勁要證明自己。"),a("{mate} never sat alone while he was out: you saw to that at every home game. He came back flying.","{mate}缺阵期间从没落单过：每个主场你都陪在他身边。他回来时状态火热。","{mate}缺陣期間從沒落單過：每個主場你都陪在他身邊。他回來時狀態火熱。")]),o)}},{key:"plays",text:a("Ask the coach to draw up plays for you","请教练为你设计战术","請教練為你設計戰術"),lean:{ambition:1,bravery:1},apply:(e,o)=>{let n=k(e,Pe(e,.5,{charisma:1,intelligence:1}));if(n){let s=m5(e)?.swing;s&&(s.mult=Math.min(1.45,s.mult+.12)),ye(e,2)}else he(e,-2);Da(e,n,xe(e,"bx_role_out.plays.ok",[a("The coach drew up three new plays with your name on them while {mate} was out.","{mate}缺阵期间，教练专门为你设计了三套新战术。","{mate}缺陣期間，教練專門為你設計了三套新戰術。"),a("You asked for the ball, and the coach listened. While {mate} was out, three new plays ended in your hands.","你要球，教练听进去了。{mate}缺阵期间，三套新战术最后都落在你手里。","你要球，教練聽進去了。{mate}缺陣期間，三套新戰術最後都落在你手上。"),a("With {mate} out, the coach opened his notebook and drew three plays for you. The fans liked every one of them.","{mate}缺阵期间，教练翻开本子，为你画了三套战术。球迷每一套都喜欢。","{mate}缺陣期間，教練翻開本子，為你畫了三套戰術。球迷每一套都喜歡。")]),xe(e,"bx_role_out.plays.bad",[a("The coach said he already had plays, thanks. He did not sound thankful.","教练说他已经有战术了，谢谢。听起来一点都不像在谢你。","教練說他已經有戰術了，謝謝。聽起來一點都不像在謝你。"),a("You offered the coach some plays. He said he had a playbook already, and his tone said the rest.","你向教练提了几套战术。他说他已经有战术本了，那语气已经说明了一切。","你向教練提了幾套戰術。他說他已經有戰術本了，那語氣已經說明了一切。"),a("The coach thanked you for your ideas in a voice that meant the opposite.","教练谢了你的想法，可那语气完全是另一个意思。","教練謝了你的想法，可那語氣完全是另一個意思。")]),o)}},{key:"study",text:a("Study how {mate} fits in the offence","研究{mate}在进攻里扮演的角色","研究{mate}在進攻裡扮演的角色"),lean:{intelligence:1,curiosity:1},apply:(e,o)=>{let n=k(e,.4);n?be(e,["iq"],1):we(e,1),Da(e,n,xe(e,"bx_role_out.study.ok",[a("You watched every possession {mate} played this season and learned a part of the game you had never seen.","你把{mate}本季的每个回合都看了一遍，学到了以前从没注意过的东西。","你把{mate}本季的每個回合都看了一遍，學到了以前從沒注意過的東西。"),a("You went through every one of {mate}’s possessions this season on film and found a side of the game you had missed.","你把{mate}本季每一个回合的录像都过了一遍，发现了比赛中你一直没注意到的一面。","你把{mate}本季每一個回合的影片都看了一遍，發現了比賽中你一直沒注意到的一面。"),a("Hours of {mate} on film taught you something new: how he saw the floor, and how you never had.","看了几个小时{mate}的录像，你学到了新东西：他怎么看场上的局面，而你以前从没这样看过。","看了幾個小時{mate}的影片，你學到了新東西：他怎麼看場上的局面，而你以前從沒這樣看過。")]),xe(e,"bx_role_out.study.bad",[a("You studied {mate}’s role on film. It helped you fill in, a little.","你看录像研究{mate}的角色，顶替他的时候多少有点帮助。","你看影片研究{mate}的角色，頂替他的時候多少有點幫助。"),a("Film of {mate} gave you a few ideas for filling in. Not many, but a few.","看{mate}的录像让你在顶替他时有了些想法。不多，但有几个。","看{mate}的影片讓你在頂替他時有了些想法。不多，但有幾個。"),a("You watched {mate} on film until your eyes hurt. It made filling in a little easier, and that was all.","你看{mate}的录像看到眼睛发酸。顶替他时轻松了一点，也就这样了。","你看{mate}的影片看到眼睛發痠。頂替他時輕鬆了一點，也就這樣了。")]),o)}},{key:"young",text:a("Push the coach to play the youngest player more","劝教练多给最年轻的球员机会","勸教練多給最年輕的球員機會"),lean:{empathy:1,patience:1},apply:(e,o)=>{let n=m5(e)?.swing;n&&(n.mult=Math.max(1.05,n.mult-.12)),ce(e,4),he(e,1),d(e,xe(e,"bx_role_out.young.line",[a("You told the coach the youngest player was ready. While {mate} was out, the kid got his minutes, and you got fewer shots.","你告诉教练最年轻的那个已经准备好了。{mate}缺阵期间，小伙子拿到了时间，你的出手少了些。","你告訴教練最年輕的那個已經準備好了。{mate}缺陣期間，小夥子拿到了時間，你的出手少了些。"),a("You told the coach the youngest player was ready for {mate}’s minutes. The kid got them, and your shots went down a little.","你告诉教练，{mate}的上场时间可以交给最年轻的那个。小伙子拿到了，你的出手少了一点。","你告訴教練，{mate}的上場時間可以交給最年輕的那個。小夥子拿到了，你的出手少了一點。"),a("With {mate} out, you vouched for the youngest player. He got the minutes; you gave up a few shots, and did not mind.","{mate}缺阵期间，你替最年轻的那个打了包票。他拿到了上场时间，你让出了几次出手，也不在意。","{mate}缺陣期間，你替最年輕的那個打了包票。他拿到了上場時間，你讓出了幾次出手，也不在意。")]),o)}}]},bx_role_cut:{keep:["practice"],answers:[{key:"agent",text:a("Have your agent call the front office","让经纪人打电话给管理层","讓經紀人打電話給管理層"),hint:a("Coaches hear who called","教练会知道是谁打的电话","教練會知道是誰打的電話"),lean:{ambition:1,risk:1},base:.3,apply:(e,o)=>{let n=k(e,.35),s=m5(e)?.swing;n?(s&&(s.len=Math.max(2,Math.ceil(s.len/2))),he(e,-2)):(he(e,-5),Ko(e,-1)),Da(e,n,a("The front office had a quiet word. Your minutes came back early, and the coach knew why.","管理层私下打了招呼。你的上场时间提前回来了，教练也知道是怎么回事。","管理層私下打了招呼。你的上場時間提前回來了，教練也知道是怎麼回事。"),a("The coach heard who your agent had called. The minutes stayed with {mate}.","教练知道了你的经纪人打给了谁。上场时间还是给了{mate}。","教練知道了你的經紀人打給了誰。上場時間還是給了{mate}。"),o)}},{key:"loud",text:a("Be the loudest voice on the bench","在板凳上当最大声的那个","在板凳上當最大聲的那個"),lean:{charisma:1,empathy:1},apply:e=>{ce(e,4),ye(e,1),l(e,"happiness",-1),d(e,a("You cheered every basket from the bench, even the ones that should have been yours. The crowd started cheering you back.","你在板凳上为每一个进球欢呼，包括那些本该是你投的。观众也开始为你欢呼。","你在板凳上為每一個進球歡呼，包括那些本該是你投的。觀眾也開始為你歡呼。"))}},{key:"extra",text:a("Ask the assistant coaches for extra work","找助理教练加练","找助理教練加練"),lean:{discipline:1,curiosity:1},apply:e=>{he(e,2);let o=k(e,.4);o?be(e,[G_(e.ball)],1):we(e,1),Da(e,o,a("The assistants worked on your weakest spot every morning. It is not your weakest spot any more.","助理教练们每天早上陪你练最弱的环节。现在它已经不是你最弱的地方了。","助理教練們每天早上陪你練最弱的環節。現在它已經不是你最弱的地方了。"),a("Extra mornings with the assistants. Your legs stayed sharp, waiting for minutes.","你和助理教练们多练了好几个早上。双腿保持着状态，等着上场时间。","你和助理教練們多練了好幾個早上。雙腿保持著狀態，等著上場時間。"))}},{key:"sulk",text:a("Let everyone see you are unhappy","让所有人都看到你不高兴","讓所有人都看到你不高興"),hint:a("It can work, or it can cost you","可能有用，也可能害了你","可能有用，也可能害了你"),lean:{patience:-2},base:.3,apply:(e,o)=>{let n=k(e,.3),s=m5(e)?.swing;n?(s&&(s.len=Math.max(2,s.len-2)),l(e,"happiness",1)):(he(e,-4),ce(e,-3)),Da(e,n,a("Your face said everything. The coach gave the minutes back sooner, if only to stop seeing it.","你的脸上写满了不满。教练提早把时间还给了你，大概只是不想再看到那张脸。","你的臉上寫滿了不滿。教練提早把時間還給了你，大概只是不想再看到那張臉。"),a("You sulked on the bench for all to see. The coach saw it, and so did {mate}.","你在板凳上闹情绪，所有人都看见了。教练看见了，{mate}也看见了。","你在板凳上鬧情緒，所有人都看見了。教練看見了，{mate}也看見了。"),o)}},{key:"rest",text:a("Use the time to rest your body","趁机让身体休息一下","趁機讓身體休息一下"),lean:{patience:2},apply:e=>{l(e,"health",2),we(e,-1),d(e,a("Fewer minutes meant fewer bruises. Your body felt better than it had all season, your touch a little worse.","上场少了，伤也少了。身体感觉是整季最好的，手感却差了一点。","上場少了，傷也少了。身體感覺是整季最好的，手感卻差了一點。"))}}]},bx_win_run:{answers:[{key:"socks",text:a("Keep everything the same, down to the socks","一切照旧，连袜子都不换","一切照舊，連襪子都不換"),lean:{creativity:1,risk:1},apply:(e,o)=>{let n=k(e,.6);n?(ec(e,.15),ce(e,2)):(ec(e,-.1),ce(e,1)),Da(e,n,a("Nobody at {team} washed anything lucky for a week. The streak lived on, and so did the smell.","{team}整整一周没人洗任何幸运物。连胜还在继续，味道也是。","{team}整整一週沒人洗任何幸運物。連勝還在繼續，味道也是。"),a("The lucky socks went into the wash by mistake. The whole team blamed the laundry for the next loss.","幸运袜被不小心拿去洗了。下一场输球，全队都怪洗衣房。","幸運襪被不小心拿去洗了。下一場輸球，全隊都怪洗衣房。"),o)}},{key:"flaws",text:a("Find what is still going wrong","找出还在出问题的地方","找出還在出問題的地方"),lean:{intelligence:1,discipline:1},apply:e=>{he(e,3),ec(e,.1),l(e,"happiness",-1),d(e,a("While everyone celebrated, you went through the film for mistakes. You found plenty, and the coach liked that you looked.","大家都在庆祝的时候，你在录像里找错误。你找到了不少，教练很欣赏你这么做。","大家都在慶祝的時候，你在影片裡找錯誤。你找到了不少，教練很欣賞你這麼做。"))}},{key:"fans",text:a("Thank the fans at the next home game","下个主场向球迷致谢","下個主場向球迷致謝"),lean:{charisma:1,empathy:1},apply:(e,o)=>{ye(e,3),l(e,"happiness",1),d(e,a("You took the microphone at the next home game and thanked the fans of {team}. They chanted your name.","下个主场你拿起麦克风，感谢{team}的球迷。他们高喊你的名字。","下個主場你拿起麥克風，感謝{team}的球迷。他們高喊你的名字。"),o)}},{key:"family",text:a("Bring your family to a game","带家人来看一场比赛","帶家人來看一場比賽"),lean:{empathy:2},apply:e=>{l(e,"relationships",3),we(e,1),d(e,a("Your family watched a win from the good seats. You looked up at them after every basket.","家人坐在好位置上，看你们赢了一场。你每进一球都抬头看他们。","家人坐在好位子上，看你們贏了一場。你每進一球都抬頭看他們。"))}},{key:"rookies",text:a("Hand the rookies the post-game music","把赛后放歌的权力交给新秀","把賽後放歌的權力交給菜鳥"),lean:{empathy:1,creativity:1},apply:e=>{let o=k(e,.5);ce(e,o?4:1),Da(e,o,a("The rookies ran the music after every win. The veterans pretended to hate it, then learned the words.","每场胜利后都由新秀放歌。老将们假装讨厌，后来都学会了歌词。","每場勝利後都由菜鳥放歌。老將們假裝討厭，後來都學會了歌詞。"),a("The rookies played the same song eleven times in a row. You still hear it in your sleep.","新秀们把同一首歌连放了十一遍。你到现在做梦都还听得到。","菜鳥們把同一首歌連放了十一遍。你到現在做夢都還聽得到。"))}}]},bx_lose_run:{answers:[{key:"film",text:a("Watch every loss with the coaches","和教练组一起把每场败仗看一遍","和教練團一起把每場敗仗看一遍"),lean:{intelligence:1,patience:1},apply:e=>{he(e,3),ec(e,.1),l(e,"happiness",-1),d(e,a("Five losses on film, twice each. It hurt to watch, and you found three things to fix.","五场败仗，每场看两遍。看得很痛苦，但你找到了三个要改的地方。","五場敗仗，每場看兩遍。看得很痛苦，但你找到了三個要改的地方。"))}},{key:"fun",text:a("Bring some fun back with a shooting game","办个投篮游戏，把乐趣找回来","辦個投籃遊戲，把樂趣找回來"),lean:{charisma:1,creativity:1},apply:e=>{let o=k(e,Pe(e,.5,{charisma:1,creativity:1}));o?(ce(e,4),ec(e,.2)):ce(e,-1),Da(e,o,a("Half-court shots for push-ups after practice. For the first time in two weeks, the gym was loud.","训练后比半场投篮，输的做俯卧撑。两个星期以来，球馆第一次这么热闹。","練球後比半場投籃，輸的做伏地挺身。兩個星期以來，球館第一次這麼熱鬧。"),a("Nobody was in the mood for games. It lasted four minutes.","大家都没心情玩游戏，四分钟就散了。","大家都沒心情玩遊戲，四分鐘就散了。"))}},{key:"offline",text:a("Stay off your phone and the comments","远离手机和网上的评论","遠離手機和網路上的留言"),lean:{discipline:1,patience:1},apply:e=>{l(e,"happiness",2),ye(e,-1),d(e,a("You put the phone away until the losing stopped. You slept better, and missed a few kind messages too.","连败结束之前你都不碰手机。你睡得好些了，也错过了几条暖心的留言。","連敗結束之前你都不碰手機。你睡得好些了，也錯過了幾則暖心的留言。"))}},{key:"dinner",text:a("Take the struggling young players to dinner","请状态低迷的年轻球员吃饭","請狀態低迷的年輕球員吃飯"),lean:{empathy:2},apply:e=>{me(e,-ve(e)*.02,"spent"),ce(e,4),d(e,a("You took the young players to dinner and talked about anything but basketball. They played looser the next night.","你请年轻球员们吃饭，聊什么都行，就是不聊篮球。第二天晚上他们打得放松多了。","你請年輕球員們吃飯，聊什麼都好，就是不聊籃球。隔天晚上他們打得放鬆多了。"))}}]},bx_race:{answers:[{key:"scout",text:a("Study the teams around you in the table","研究积分榜上身边的对手","研究積分榜上身邊的對手"),lean:{intelligence:1,curiosity:1},apply:e=>{he(e,2),ec(e,.1),d(e,xe(e,"bx_race.scout.line",[a("You knew every rival’s last eight games by heart. The coach borrowed your notes.","你把每个对手的最后八场都背了下来。教练还借走了你的笔记。","你把每個對手的最後八場都背了下來。教練還借走了你的筆記。"),a("You studied every team in the race, game by game. By the end the coach was asking you before the scouts.","你把争排名的每支球队一场一场地研究了一遍。到最后，教练先问你，再问球探。","你把爭排名的每支球隊一場一場地研究了一遍。到最後，教練先問你，再問球探。"),a("Your notebook on the rivals’ last eight games went around the locker room. The coach kept it on his desk.","你那本记着对手最后八场的笔记在更衣室里传了一圈，最后被教练留在了他桌上。","你那本記著對手最後八場的筆記在休息室裡傳了一圈，最後被教練留在了他桌上。")]))}},{key:"crowd",text:a("Call on the home crowd online","在网上号召主场球迷","在網路上號召主場球迷"),lean:{charisma:2},apply:e=>{let o=k(e,ke(e,{charisma:2}));o?(ye(e,3),ec(e,.15)):ye(e,-1),Da(e,o,xe(e,"bx_race.crowd.ok",[a("You asked the fans to fill the arena for the run-in. They did, and they were loud.","你号召球迷在冲刺阶段坐满球馆。他们来了，而且喊得震天响。","你號召球迷在衝刺階段坐滿球館。他們來了，而且喊得震天價響。"),a("You put out a call for the last stretch: fill every seat. They did, and the noise carried the team.","你在最后冲刺前发出号召：坐满每一个座位。他们做到了，那股声浪推着球队往前走。","你在最後衝刺前發出號召：坐滿每一個座位。他們做到了，那股聲浪推著球隊往前走。"),a("Your post asked the fans to come to the last few home games. The arena was full and loud every night.","你发帖请球迷来看最后几个主场。每一晚球馆都坐满了，而且很吵。","你發文請球迷來看最後幾個主場。每一晚球館都坐滿了，而且很吵。")]),xe(e,"bx_race.crowd.bad",[a("Your post read like a plea. Rival fans had a lot of fun with it.","你的帖子读起来像在哀求，对手球迷拿它玩得很开心。","你的貼文讀起來像在哀求，對手球迷拿它玩得很開心。"),a("You meant it as a rallying cry. Rival fans read it as begging and made sure everyone saw.","你本想鼓舞人心。对手球迷却把它读成了乞求，还到处转发，生怕有人没看到。","你本想鼓舞人心。對手球迷卻把它讀成了乞求，還到處轉傳，生怕有人沒看到。"),a("Your call to the fans came out wrong. Rival fans turned it into a joke for a week.","你对球迷的号召说岔了。对手球迷拿它当了一整周的笑话。","你對球迷的號召說岔了。對手球迷拿它當了一整週的笑話。")]))}},{key:"rest",text:a("Ask for one night off to save your legs","申请休息一场，保住双腿","申請休息一場，保住雙腿"),lean:{patience:1,intelligence:1},apply:e=>{l(e,"health",3),he(e,-1),ec(e,-.1),d(e,xe(e,"bx_race.rest.line",[a("You sat out one night of the run-in. Your legs thanked you; a few fans did not.","冲刺阶段你休息了一场。双腿很感激，有些球迷可不这么想。","衝刺階段你休息了一場。雙腿很感激，有些球迷可不這麼想。"),a("You took one night off in the run-in. Your body felt better for it, and some fans let you know they did not.","冲刺阶段你休了一晚。身体舒服多了，有些球迷却毫不掩饰他们的不满。","衝刺階段你休了一晚。身體舒服多了，有些球迷卻毫不掩飾他們的不滿。"),a("One night in street clothes during the run-in. Good for the legs, less good for the fans who came to see you.","冲刺阶段有一晚你穿便服坐在场边。对双腿是好事，对来看你的球迷就没那么好了。","衝刺階段有一晚你穿便服坐在場邊。對雙腿是好事，對來看你的球迷就沒那麼好了。")]))}},{key:"stopper",text:a("Take the toughest defensive job every night","每晚都接下最难的防守任务","每晚都接下最難的防守任務"),lean:{discipline:1,bravery:1},apply:e=>{let o=k(e,se(e,.5,[LQ(e)],{discipline:1}));o?(ec(e,.25),he(e,3)):we(e,-1),Da(e,o,xe(e,"bx_race.stopper.ok",[a("You took their best scorer every night of the run-in. Most nights he was not their best scorer by the end.","冲刺阶段每晚你都盯对方头号得分手。大部分晚上，到最后他都不是头号得分手了。","衝刺階段每晚你都盯對方頭號得分手。大部分晚上，到最後他都不是頭號得分手了。"),a("Every night of the run-in, their best scorer had you on him. Most nights someone else ended up leading them.","冲刺阶段每一晚，对方头号得分手身上都贴着你。大多数晚上，最后带队得分的都换成了别人。","衝刺階段每一晚，對方頭號得分手身上都貼著你。大多數晚上，最後帶隊得分的都換成了別人。"),a("You asked for their best scorer every night and got him. By the final buzzer he was usually a step behind his own average.","你每晚都主动要求去防对方头号得分手。终场时，他通常都离自己的场均差了一截。","你每晚都主動要求去防對方頭號得分手。終場時，他通常都離自己的場均差了一截。")]),xe(e,"bx_race.stopper.bad",[a("You chased their best scorer every night, and he still got his. Your own shot suffered for it.","你每晚都追着对方头号得分手跑，他还是拿到了他的分，你自己的投篮也受了影响。","你每晚都追著對方頭號得分手跑，他還是拿到了他的分，你自己的投籃也受了影響。"),a("You took their best scorer every night and he scored anyway. All that chasing cost your own shot.","你每晚都防对方头号得分手，他还是照样得分。这么一路追，你自己的投篮也跟着丢了手感。","你每晚都防對方頭號得分手，他還是照樣得分。這麼一路追，你自己的投籃也跟著丟了手感。"),a("Their best scorers got their points through you, night after night, and your legs had nothing left for your own shots.","一晚又一晚，对方头号得分手都在你头上拿到了分，你的腿也没力气投自己的篮了。","一晚又一晚，對方頭號得分手都在你頭上拿到了分，你的腿也沒力氣投自己的籃了。")]))}},{key:"table",text:a("Fine anyone who mentions the table","谁提积分榜就罚谁","誰提積分榜就罰誰"),lean:{discipline:1,creativity:1},apply:e=>{let o=k(e,.6);ce(e,o?3:1),o||l(e,"happiness",1),Da(e,o,xe(e,"bx_race.table.ok",[a("Anyone who mentioned the table paid into a jar. It bought the team dinner, and nobody checked the standings.","谁提积分榜谁就往罐子里投钱。最后够请全队吃一顿，也没人再去看排名。","誰提積分榜誰就往罐子裡投錢。最後夠請全隊吃一頓，也沒人再去看排名。"),a("You banned talk of the standings, with a fine for every slip. The fines paid for a team dinner, and the team stayed loose.","你禁止谈论积分榜，说漏嘴就罚钱。罚款够全队吃一顿饭，大家也一直很放松。","你禁止談論積分榜，說溜嘴就罰錢。罰款夠全隊吃一頓飯，大家也一直很放鬆。"),a("The standings jar filled up fast, mostly with rookies’ money. It bought dinner, and the table stopped mattering.","积分榜罐子很快就满了，大部分是新秀的钱。最后请了一顿饭，排名也没人在意了。","積分榜罐子很快就滿了，大部分是新秀的錢。最後請了一頓飯，排名也沒人在意了。")]),xe(e,"bx_race.table.bad",[a("You were the first one fined. Then the second.","第一个被罚的是你，第二个也是你。","第一個被罰的是你，第二個也是你。"),a("It was your rule, and you broke it first. And second.","规矩是你定的，第一个破坏规矩的也是你。第二个还是你。","規矩是你定的，第一個破壞規矩的也是你。第二個還是你。"),a("You set up the jar for talk of the table. Your money went in first, then again before the week was out.","你设了那个提积分榜就罚钱的罐子。第一笔钱是你投的，不到一周又投了一笔。","你設了那個提積分榜就罰錢的罐子。第一筆錢是你投的，不到一週又投了一筆。")]))}}]},press_loss:{answers:[{key:"sorry",text:a("Apologise to the fans who travelled","向远道而来的球迷道歉","向遠道而來的球迷道歉"),lean:{empathy:1,honesty:1},apply:e=>{ye(e,3),ce(e,-1),d(e,a("You apologised to the fans who had travelled to see that. They forgave you; a teammate or two thought it was not your apology to make.","你向远道而来的球迷道歉。他们原谅了你，但有一两个队友觉得这轮不到你来道歉。","你向遠道而來的球迷道歉。他們原諒了你，但有一兩個隊友覺得這輪不到你來道歉。"))}},{key:"better",text:a("Say {opp} were simply better tonight","直说今晚{opp}就是比你们强","直說今晚{opp}就是比你們強"),lean:{honesty:1,patience:1},apply:(e,o)=>{let n=k(e,.6);n?l(e,"reputation",2):ye(e,-2),Da(e,n,a("You said {opp} were the better team tonight, plain and simple. Even their fans liked you for it.","你说今晚{opp}就是更好的球队，就这么简单。连他们的球迷都因此对你有好感。","你說今晚{opp}就是更好的球隊，就這麼簡單。連他們的球迷都因此對你有好感。"),a("You said {opp} were better. Your own fans wanted more fight than that.","你说{opp}比你们强。你们自己的球迷想听到的是更有血性的话。","你說{opp}比你們強。你們自己的球迷想聽到的是更有血性的話。"),o)}}]},press_night:{answers:[{key:"trainer",text:a("Give the game ball to the trainer who taped your ankles","把这场的比赛球送给队医，谢谢他每场帮你包扎脚踝","把這場的比賽球送給防護員，謝謝他每場幫你貼紮腳踝"),lean:{empathy:1,charisma:1},apply:e=>{ce(e,3),l(e,"happiness",1),d(e,a("You handed the game ball to the trainer who tapes your ankles. He kept it on his desk all season.","你把比赛球送给了每场帮你包扎脚踝的队医。他把它摆在桌上放了一整季。","你把比賽球送給了每場幫你貼紮腳踝的防護員。他把它擺在桌上放了一整季。"))}},{key:"next",text:a("Say you already want the next game","说你已经在等下一场了","說你已經在等下一場了"),lean:{ambition:1,discipline:1},apply:e=>{let o=k(e,ke(e,{discipline:1,ambition:1}));o?(we(e,1),he(e,2)):we(e,-1),Da(e,o,a("You said the night was already over for you; the next game mattered. You played that one just as well.","你说这一晚对你来说已经结束了，下一场才重要。结果下一场你打得一样好。","你說這一晚對你來說已經結束了，下一場才重要。結果下一場你打得一樣好。"),a("You said you wanted the next game. Then you went 3 for 15 in it, and the clip came back.","你说你已经在等下一场了。结果下一场你15投3中，那段话又被翻了出来。","你說你已經在等下一場了。結果下一場你15投3中，那段話又被翻了出來。"))}}]},press_academy:{answers:[{key:"drill",text:a("Show them a drill instead of talking","不说话，直接示范一个训练","不說話，直接示範一個訓練"),hint:a("Live, on camera","现场直播，在镜头前","現場直播，在鏡頭前"),lean:{creativity:1,bravery:1},apply:e=>{let o=k(e,ke(e,{creativity:1,charisma:1}));o?(Og(e,"prestige",2),qA(e,2)):Og(e,"prestige",-1),Da(e,o,a("The boys ran your favourite drill on camera, crisp as a clock. The clip made the evening news.","孩子们在镜头前把你最爱的训练跑得干净利落。这段画面上了晚间新闻。","孩子們在鏡頭前把你最愛的訓練跑得乾淨俐落。這段影片上了晚間新聞。"),a("The drill fell apart on camera, and a loose ball hit the cameraman. That was the part they used.","训练在镜头前乱成一团，一颗乱飞的球还砸中了摄影师。电视台用的就是这一段。","訓練在鏡頭前亂成一團，一顆亂飛的球還砸中了攝影師。電視台用的就是這一段。"))}},{key:"school",text:a("Talk about school marks as much as basketball","谈学业跟谈篮球一样多","談學業跟談籃球一樣多"),lean:{honesty:1,patience:1},apply:e=>{$e(e,3),d(e,a("You talked about homework as much as jump shots. The families watching at home liked that most of all.","你谈功课的时间和谈跳投一样多。在家看节目的家长们最喜欢这一点。","你談功課的時間和談跳投一樣多。在家看節目的家長們最喜歡這一點。"))}},{key:"boy",text:a("Let one of the boys answer instead","让一个孩子来回答","讓一個孩子來回答"),hint:a("Twelve-year-olds say anything","十二岁的孩子什么都敢说","十二歲的孩子什麼都敢說"),lean:{empathy:1,risk:1},apply:e=>{let o=k(e,.5);o?(qA(e,3),Og(e,"prestige",1)):Og(e,"prestige",-1),Da(e,o,a("A twelve-year-old said the difference was that nobody yells, they teach. The reporter had nothing to add.","一个十二岁的孩子说，不同之处在于这里没人吼，大家都在教。记者都不知道该补充什么了。","一個十二歲的孩子說，不同之處在於這裡沒人吼，大家都在教。記者都不知道該補充什麼了。"),a("A twelve-year-old said the difference was that the coach falls asleep in film sessions. It aired twice.","一个十二岁的孩子说，不同之处在于教练看录像时会睡着。这段播了两次。","一個十二歲的孩子說，不同之處在於教練看影片時會睡著。這段播了兩次。"))}}],words:[{drill:a("Let a drill speak for you","让一个训练替你说话","讓一個訓練替你說話"),school:a("Put the boys’ schoolwork next to their basketball","把孩子们的功课和篮球放在一起谈","把孩子們的功課和籃球放在一起談"),boy:a("Hand the microphone to one of the boys","把麦克风交给一个孩子","把麥克風交給一個孩子")}]},press_close_loss:{answers:[{key:"call",text:a("Say it was the play call, not him","说问题在战术，不在他","說問題在戰術，不在他"),hint:a("The coach drew that play","那个战术是教练画的","那個戰術是教練畫的"),lean:{honesty:1,bravery:1},base:.4,apply:(e,o)=>{ce(e,3);let n=k(e,.4);he(e,n?1:-5),Da(e,n,a("You said the play call was wrong, not {mate}. The coach said the same thing at his own press conference the next day.","你说错在战术，不在{mate}。第二天教练在他自己的记者会上也这么说了。","你說錯在戰術，不在{mate}。隔天教練在他自己的記者會上也這麼說了。"),a("You said the play call was wrong, not {mate}. The coach had drawn up that play himself.","你说错在战术，不在{mate}。那个战术正是教练亲手画的。","你說錯在戰術，不在{mate}。那個戰術正是教練親手畫的。"),o)}},{key:"credit",text:a("Credit {opp} for the defence on the last play","称赞{opp}最后一球的防守","稱讚{opp}最後一球的防守"),lean:{patience:1,honesty:1},apply:(e,o)=>{l(e,"reputation",2),ce(e,1),d(e,a("You said {opp} made a great defensive play at the end. Nobody could argue, and {mate} was off the hook.","你说{opp}最后那一下防守非常漂亮。没人能反驳，{mate}也就脱身了。","你說{opp}最後那一下防守非常漂亮。沒人能反駁，{mate}也就脫身了。"),o)}},{key:"ball",text:a("Say you want the ball next time it is that close","说下次比分这么接近，你要球","說下次比分這麼接近，你要球"),hint:a("He may read it the wrong way","他可能会误会你的意思","他可能會誤會你的意思"),lean:{ambition:2,bravery:1},apply:(e,o)=>{let n=k(e,ke(e,{bravery:1,ambition:1}));n?(ye(e,2),we(e,1)):ce(e,-3),Da(e,n,a("You said next time it is that close, the ball comes to you. The fans loved it, and {mate} said he would be glad to give it.","你说下次比分这么接近，球就给你。球迷很喜欢，{mate}说他很乐意把球交给你。","你說下次比分這麼接近，球就給你。球迷很喜歡，{mate}說他很樂意把球交給你。"),a("You said you wanted the ball next time. {mate} read it as you saying he should never have had it.","你说下次你要球。{mate}听成了你觉得他根本不该拿球。","你說下次你要球。{mate}聽成了你覺得他根本不該拿球。"),o)}}]},press_academy_pros:{answers:[{key:"name",text:a("Name the next one on air","在镜头前点名下一个","在鏡頭前點名下一個"),hint:a("A heavy thing to put on a boy","这对一个孩子来说负担很重","這對一個孩子來說負擔很重"),lean:{ambition:1,risk:1},apply:e=>{let o=k(e,.5);o?Og(e,"prestige",3):qA(e,-3),Da(e,o,a("You named the boy you think is next. Three scouts called that week, and he grew an inch in confidence.","你点名了你认为的下一个。那一周就有三个球探打电话来，那孩子自信心大涨。","你點名了你認為的下一個。那一週就有三個球探打電話來，那孩子自信心大漲。"),a("You named the boy you think is next. He stopped sleeping, and the others stopped passing to him.","你点名了你认为的下一个。他开始睡不着，其他孩子也不太传球给他了。","你點名了你認為的下一個。他開始睡不著，其他孩子也不太傳球給他了。"))}},{key:"coaches",text:a("Credit your coaches one by one","一个个点名感谢你的教练","一個個點名感謝你的教練"),lean:{empathy:1,honesty:1},apply:e=>{Og(e,"coaches",3),$e(e,1),d(e,a("You named every coach on your staff on air. One of them called his mother to tell her.","你在镜头前点名了每一位教练。其中一位马上打电话告诉了他妈妈。","你在鏡頭前點名了每一位教練。其中一位馬上打電話告訴了他媽媽。"))}},{key:"didnt",text:a("Talk about the boys who did not make it","谈谈那些没能打上职业的孩子","談談那些沒能打上職業的孩子"),lean:{honesty:2},apply:e=>{let o=k(e,.6);$e(e,o?4:-2),Da(e,o,a("You talked about the boys who did not turn pro and what they became. Families said it was the most honest thing a coach had said on TV.","你谈到那些没打上职业的孩子，以及他们后来的样子。家长们说，这是他们在电视上听过教练说的最真诚的话。","你談到那些沒打上職業的孩子，以及他們後來的樣子。家長們說，這是他們在電視上聽過教練說的最真誠的話。"),a("You talked about the boys who did not make it. One family took it as being about their son.","你谈到那些没能打上职业的孩子。有一家人觉得你在说他们的儿子。","你談到那些沒能打上職業的孩子。有一家人覺得你在說他們的兒子。"))}},{key:"joke",text:a("Say the secret is your terrible cooking","说秘诀是你做的饭太难吃","說祕訣是你做的飯太難吃"),hint:a("It may not land","不一定有人笑","不一定有人笑"),lean:{charisma:2,creativity:1},apply:e=>{let o=Js(e);o?qA(e,2):Og(e,"prestige",-1),Da(e,o,a("You said the boys turn pro to get away from your cooking. The squad laughed for a week.","你说孩子们拼命打上职业，就是为了逃离你做的饭。全队笑了整整一个星期。","你說孩子們拚命打上職業，就是為了逃離你做的飯。全隊笑了整整一個星期。"),a('You said the secret was your terrible cooking. The channel ran it under the headline "Academy food scandal".',"你说秘诀是你做的饭太难吃。频道配上的标题是「学院伙食丑闻」。","你說祕訣是你做的飯太難吃。頻道配上的標題是「學院伙食醜聞」。"))}}]},benched:{keep:["work","talk"],wide:.3,answers:[{key:"film",text:a("Watch the second half on film that night","当晚看下半场的录像","當晚看下半場的影片"),lean:{intelligence:1,discipline:1},apply:e=>{let o=k(e,.5);he(e,o?4:1),o||l(e,"happiness",-1),Da(e,o,a("You found the three plays where you were out of position. The next day you told the coach before he could tell you.","你找到了自己站错位置的三个回合。第二天，你抢在教练开口之前先说了。","你找到了自己站錯位置的三個回合。隔天，你搶在教練開口之前先說了。"),a("You watched the second half three times and still could not see what he saw.","你把下半场看了三遍，还是看不出他看到了什么。","你把下半場看了三遍，還是看不出他看到了什麼。"))}},{key:"vet",text:a("Ask a veteran what the coach wants","问老将教练想要什么","問老將教練想要什麼"),lean:{empathy:1,curiosity:1},apply:e=>{ce(e,3),he(e,2),d(e,a("A veteran told you what the coach never says out loud: talk on defence. You talked, and he noticed.","一个老将告诉你教练从来不明说的事：防守时要多喊话。你照做了，教练注意到了。","一個老將告訴你教練從來不明說的事：防守時要多喊話。你照做了，教練注意到了。"))}},{key:"cheer",text:a("Be the loudest voice on the bench","在板凳上喊得最大声","在板凳上喊得最大聲"),lean:{charisma:1,empathy:1},apply:e=>{ce(e,4),ye(e,1),l(e,"happiness",-1),d(e,a("You cheered every basket from the bench, towel over your shoulder. It stung, and your teammates loved you for it.","你肩上搭着毛巾，在板凳上为每一个进球欢呼。心里不好受，但队友们因此更喜欢你了。","你肩上搭著毛巾，在板凳上為每一個進球歡呼。心裡不好受，但隊友們因此更喜歡你了。"))}},{key:"agent",text:a("Call your agent that night","当晚打电话给经纪人","當晚打電話給經紀人"),hint:a("Coaches hear who called","教练会知道是谁打的电话","教練會知道是誰打的電話"),lean:{ambition:2,patience:-1},base:.3,apply:e=>{let o=k(e,.3);o?he(e,1):(he(e,-6),Ko(e,-1)),Da(e,o,a("Your agent had a quiet word with the club. You played the whole of the next game.","经纪人和球队私下谈了谈。下一场你打满了全场。","經紀人和球隊私下談了談。下一場你打滿了全場。"),a("The coach found out who your agent had called. The bench got a little colder.","教练知道了你的经纪人打给了谁。你在板凳上坐得更久了。","教練知道了你的經紀人打給了誰。你在板凳上坐得更久了。"))}},{key:"laugh",text:a("Laugh it off over dinner","晚饭时一笑置之","晚餐時一笑置之"),lean:{resilience:1,charisma:1},apply:e=>{l(e,"happiness",2),_(e,"resilience",1),d(e,a("You joked at dinner that you had the best seat in the house for the second half. It hurt less after that.","晚饭时你开玩笑说，下半场你坐的是全场最好的位置。说完就没那么难受了。","晚餐時你開玩笑說，下半場你坐的是全場最好的位子。說完就沒那麼難受了。"))}}]},game_plan:{answers:[{key:"press",text:a("Press them full-court all night","整场全场紧逼","整場全場緊逼"),lean:{risk:1,bravery:1},apply:e=>Iv(e,k(e,Pe(e,.4,{intelligence:1,bravery:1})),xe(e,"game_plan.press.ok",[a("Your press turned them over nine times in the first half. Their coach ran out of timeouts.","你的全场紧逼让他们上半场就失误九次，对方教练暂停都叫光了。","你的全場緊逼讓他們上半場就失誤九次，對方教練暫停都叫光了。"),a("Your full-court press forced nine turnovers before halftime. Their coach used every timeout he had.","你的全场紧逼在半场前就逼出九次失误。对方教练把暂停全用光了。","你的全場緊逼在半場前就逼出九次失誤。對方教練把暫停全用光了。"),a("Nine first-half turnovers against your press. By halftime their coach had no timeouts left and no answers.","面对你的紧逼，对方上半场失误九次。到中场时，对方教练既没有暂停，也没有办法了。","面對你的緊逼，對方上半場失誤九次。到中場時，對方教練既沒有暫停，也沒有辦法了。")]),xe(e,"game_plan.press.bad",[a("They broke your press with two passes, again and again. Easy layups all night.","他们两次传球就打破你的紧逼，一次又一次，整晚都是轻松上篮。","他們兩次傳球就打破你的緊逼，一次又一次，整晚都是輕鬆上籃。"),a("Two quick passes beat your press, every time. They spent the night laying the ball in.","两次快传就能打破你的紧逼，每次都是。他们整晚都在轻松上篮。","兩次快傳就能打破你的緊逼，每次都是。他們整晚都在輕鬆上籃。"),a("Your press had a hole two passes wide, and they found it all night. Layup after layup.","你的紧逼有个两次传球就能穿过的漏洞，他们整晚都找得到。上篮一个接一个。","你的緊逼有個兩次傳球就能穿過的漏洞，他們整晚都找得到。上籃一個接一個。")]))},{key:"star",text:a("Build everything around your best player","一切围绕你的头号球员","一切圍繞你的頭號球員"),lean:{ambition:1,intelligence:1},apply:e=>Iv(e,k(e,Pe(e,.45,{intelligence:1,ambition:1})),xe(e,"game_plan.star.ok",[a("Every play ran through your best player, and he had the night of his season.","每一套战术都围绕你的头号球员展开，他打出了本季最好的一场。","每一套戰術都圍繞你的頭號球員展開，他打出了本季最好的一場。"),a("You put the ball in your best player’s hands every trip, and he gave you his best night of the season.","每一次进攻你都把球交到头号球员手里，他回报了你本季最好的一场。","每一次進攻你都把球交到頭號球員手上，他回報了你本季最好的一場。"),a("Your plan was simple: him, every play. He had the game of his season.","你的计划很简单：每一回合都给他。他打出了本季最佳的一场。","你的計畫很簡單：每一回合都給他。他打出了本季最佳的一場。")]),xe(e,"game_plan.star.bad",[a("They sent two at your best player all night, and nobody else could make them pay.","他们整晚包夹你的头号球员，其他人谁也没能惩罚他们。","他們整晚包夾你的頭號球員，其他人誰也沒能懲罰他們。"),a("They doubled your best player every time he touched it, and the open men kept missing.","你的头号球员一碰球他们就包夹，空位的人却一直投不进。","你的頭號球員一碰球他們就包夾，空檔的人卻一直投不進。"),a("Everything ran through your best player, so they put two men on him. Nobody else stepped up.","所有战术都走你的头号球员，于是他们派两个人盯他。其他人没有一个站出来。","所有戰術都走你的頭號球員，於是他們派兩個人盯他。其他人沒有一個站出來。")]))},{key:"big",text:a("Go big: two centres on the floor together","打大阵容：双中锋同时在场","打大陣容：雙中鋒同時在場"),lean:{creativity:1,bravery:1},apply:e=>Iv(e,k(e,Pe(e,.4,{creativity:1,intelligence:1})),xe(e,"game_plan.big.ok",[a("Your two big men owned the paint. The other side gave up on layups by halftime.","你的两个大个子统治了禁区，对方半场就放弃上篮了。","你的兩個大個子統治了禁區，對方半場就放棄上籃了。"),a("You played two big men together, and the paint was yours. By halftime they had stopped driving.","你让两个大个子同时上场，禁区就是你们的。中场时对方已经不再往里突了。","你讓兩個大個子同時上場，禁區就是你們的。中場時對方已經不再往裡切了。"),a("Two big men, one wall. The other side tried the paint a few times, then settled for jump shots.","两个大个子，一堵墙。对方往禁区试了几次，然后就只能投跳投了。","兩個大個子，一堵牆。對方往禁區試了幾次，然後就只能投跳投了。")]),xe(e,"game_plan.big.bad",[a("Your two big men could not keep up. The other side ran past them all night.","你的两个大个子跟不上节奏，对方整晚都从他们身边跑过去。","你的兩個大個子跟不上節奏，對方整晚都從他們身邊跑過去。"),a("Two big men were one too many tonight. The other side ran and ran, and they could not follow.","今晚同时放两个大个子，多了一个。对方一直跑，他们跟不上。","今晚同時放兩個大個子，多了一個。對方一直跑，他們跟不上。"),a("Your big lineup was slow to get back all night. The other side scored in transition again and again.","你的大阵容整晚回防都慢半拍，对方一次又一次打快攻得分。","你的大陣容整晚回防都慢半拍，對方一次又一次打快攻得分。")]))},{key:"players",text:a("Draw up the plan together with your players","和球员们一起制定战术","和球員們一起制定戰術"),lean:{empathy:2},apply:e=>{ht(e,3),Iv(e,k(e,Pe(e,.4,{empathy:1,intelligence:1})),xe(e,"game_plan.players.ok",[a("The players played their own plan like they meant every word of it.","球员们打的是他们自己参与制定的战术，每一步都打得很投入。","球員們打的是他們自己參與制定的戰術，每一步都打得很投入。"),a("You let the players build the plan, and they ran it like it was their own, because it was.","你让球员们自己定战术，他们打得像在执行自己的战术，因为那本来就是他们的。","你讓球員們自己定戰術，他們打得像在執行自己的戰術，因為那本來就是他們的。"),a("The plan came from the locker room, and the players played it with everything they had.","战术出自更衣室，球员们拼尽全力去执行。","戰術出自休息室，球員們拚盡全力去執行。")]),xe(e,"game_plan.players.bad",[a("Five players, five plans. By the second quarter nobody was running the same one.","五个球员，五套战术。第二节还没打完，就没人在跑同一套了。","五個球員，五套戰術。第二節還沒打完，就沒人在跑同一套了。"),a("You asked the players for a plan and got five. By the second quarter each was running his own.","你让球员们出战术，结果收到了五套。第二节时每个人都在跑自己那套。","你讓球員們出戰術，結果收到了五套。第二節時每個人都在跑自己那套。"),a("Too many voices made the plan. In the second quarter it fell apart into five different games.","太多声音一起定战术。第二节时，它散成了五场不同的比赛。","太多聲音一起定戰術。第二節時，它散成了五場不同的比賽。")]))}},{key:"calls",text:a("Learn their play calls from the film","从录像里摸清他们的战术暗号","從影片裡摸清他們的戰術暗號"),lean:{intelligence:2,curiosity:1},apply:e=>{l(e,"happiness",-2),Iv(e,k(e,Pe(e,.5,{intelligence:2,patience:1})),xe(e,"game_plan.calls.ok",[a("Your players called out their plays before they ran them. The other coach changed his signals at halftime.","对方还没跑战术，你的球员就先喊出来了。对方教练中场就换了暗号。","對方還沒跑戰術，你的球員就先喊出來了。對方教練中場就換了暗號。"),a("You learned their play calls, and your players shouted each one before it started. Their coach switched his signals by halftime.","你学会了他们的战术暗号，你的球员在他们跑之前就喊了出来。中场时对方教练换了暗号。","你學會了他們的戰術暗號，你的球員在他們跑之前就喊了出來。中場時對方教練換了暗號。"),a("Every time their point guard called a play, your bench called it louder. At halftime their coach made up new signals.","对方控卫每叫一套战术，你的替补席就喊得更大声。中场时对方教练只好重新编暗号。","對方控衛每叫一套戰術，你的板凳區就喊得更大聲。中場時對方教練只好重新編暗號。")]),xe(e,"game_plan.calls.bad",[a("You stayed up all night learning their calls. They changed every one of them.","你熬了一整夜背他们的暗号，结果他们全换了。","你熬了一整夜背他們的暗號，結果他們全換了。"),a("A whole night learning their calls, and they came out with new ones.","你花了一整夜学他们的暗号，结果他们上场换了一套新的。","你花了一整夜學他們的暗號，結果他們上場換了一套新的。"),a("You knew every one of their play calls by morning. They used none of them.","到早上你已经记熟了他们所有的暗号。他们一个都没用。","到早上你已經記熟了他們所有的暗號。他們一個都沒用。")]))}}],words:[{press:a("Press from baseline to baseline","从底线紧逼到底线","從底線緊逼到底線"),star:a("Run it all through your best player","什么都交给你的头号球员","什麼都交給你的頭號球員"),big:a("Put two big men out there together","让两个大个子一起上场","讓兩個大個子一起上場"),players:a("Ask the players to build the plan with you","请球员们和你一起定战术","請球員們和你一起定戰術"),calls:a("Crack their play calls on film","在录像里破解他们的暗号","在影片裡破解他們的暗號")},{press:a("Trap them all over the floor","全场到处包夹他们","全場到處包夾他們"),star:a("Make your best player the whole plan","把头号球员当成整个计划","把頭號球員當成整個計畫"),big:a("Go tall and own the paint","打高个阵容，霸占禁区","打高個陣容，霸占禁區"),players:a("Let the locker room help draw it up","让更衣室一起来画战术","讓休息室一起來畫戰術"),calls:a("Learn what each of their signals means","弄懂他们每个暗号的意思","弄懂他們每個暗號的意思")}]},pregame_call:{answers:[{key:"worst",text:a("Tell {him} about your own worst game","跟{him}讲讲你自己打得最烂的一场","跟{him}講講你自己打得最爛的一場"),lean:{honesty:1,empathy:1},apply:(e,o)=>{ct(e,2),Rv(e,o,.5,a("{He} laughed at your worst game, then went out and had a good one. {He} called you after to say so.","{He}听你讲完最烂的那场球，笑了，然后上场打出了好比赛，赛后还打来告诉你。","{He}聽你講完最爛的那場球，笑了，然後上場打出了好比賽，賽後還打來告訴你。"),a("{He} still had a rough night, but said it looked small next to your worst game.","{He}还是打得不顺，但说跟你最烂的那场比起来，这场不算什么。","{He}還是打得不順，但說跟你最爛的那場比起來，這場不算什麼。"))}},{key:"joke",text:a("Make {him} laugh with an old family joke","用家里的老笑话逗{him}笑","用家裡的老笑話逗{him}笑"),lean:{charisma:1,creativity:1},apply:(e,o)=>{ct(e,1),Rv(e,o,.52,a("The old family joke still worked. {He} walked onto the court smiling and played like it.","家里的老笑话还是管用。{He}笑着走上球场，也打得很轻松。","家裡的老笑話還是管用。{He}笑著走上球場，也打得很輕鬆。"),a("{He} groaned at the old joke, then groaned through a hard game. {He} still thanked you.","{He}听到老笑话直叹气，接着又在一场苦战里叹了一晚上的气，但还是谢谢了你。","{He}聽到老笑話直嘆氣，接著又在一場苦戰裡嘆了一晚上的氣，但還是謝謝了你。"))}},{key:"scout",text:a("Go over the other team’s weak spots with {him}","帮{him}分析对手的弱点","幫{him}分析對手的弱點"),lean:{intelligence:2},apply:(e,o)=>{ct(e,-1),Rv(e,o,.56,a("{He} went straight at the weak spots you named and had the best game of {his} season.","{He}照你说的弱点猛攻，打出了{his}本季最好的一场。","{He}照你說的弱點猛攻，打出了{his}本季最好的一場。"),a("{He} said {he} had called for a parent, not a scout. The game did not go well either.","{He}说{he}打电话想找的是家人，不是球探。那场比赛也打得不好。","{He}說{he}打電話想找的是家人，不是球探。那場比賽也打得不好。"))}},{key:"watch",text:a("Promise {him} you will watch every minute","答应{him}每一分钟都会看","答應{him}每一分鐘都會看"),lean:{empathy:1,patience:1},apply:(e,o)=>{ct(e,2),Rv(e,o,.48,a("You watched every minute, and {he} looked up at the camera once after a big basket. You knew it was for you.","你看了每一分钟。{he}投进一个关键球后抬头看了一眼镜头，你知道那是给你的。","你看了每一分鐘。{he}投進一個關鍵球後抬頭看了一眼鏡頭，你知道那是給你的。"),a("You watched every minute of a hard night. {He} called after just to hear you had.","你看完了一场艰难比赛的每一分钟。{He}赛后打来，只是想听你说你看了。","你看完了一場艱難比賽的每一分鐘。{He}賽後打來，只是想聽你說你看了。"))}},{key:"short",text:a('Keep it short: "You have done this a thousand times."',"简单一句：「这种比赛你打过一千遍了。」","簡單一句：「這種比賽你打過一千遍了。」"),lean:{patience:1,discipline:1},apply:(e,o)=>Rv(e,o,.53,a("One sentence was all {he} needed. {He} played like it was the thousand-and-first time.","{he}只需要这一句话。{He}打得就像这是第一千零一次。","{he}只需要這一句話。{He}打得就像這是第一千零一次。"),a("{He} said a thousand times had never felt like this. It was a tough night.","{He}说打过一千遍，也从没有过这种感觉。那是艰难的一晚。","{He}說打過一千遍，也從沒有過這種感覺。那是艱難的一晚。"))}],words:[{worst:a("Share the story of your worst game","分享你打得最烂的那场比赛","分享你打得最爛的那場比賽"),joke:a("Crack the old family joke","讲那个家里的老笑话","講那個家裡的老笑話"),scout:a("Walk {him} through the other team’s holes","带{him}看看对手的漏洞","帶{him}看看對手的漏洞"),watch:a("Say you will not miss a single minute","说你一分钟都不会错过","說你一分鐘都不會錯過"),short:a('"You have played this game a thousand times."',"「这种比赛你打过一千遍了。」","「這種比賽你打過一千遍了。」")},{worst:a("Admit the night you scored zero","坦白你得零分的那个晚上","坦白你得零分的那個晚上"),joke:a("Get {him} laughing before tip-off","开赛前先把{him}逗笑","開賽前先把{him}逗笑"),scout:a("Give {him} a scouting report","给{him}一份球探报告","給{him}一份球探報告"),watch:a("Promise you will be watching","保证你会看","保證你會看"),short:a('One line: "Same game as always."',"只说一句：「跟平常一样的比赛。」","只說一句：「跟平常一樣的比賽。」")}]}};
